<!doctype lake><title>𝑮𝒆𝒏𝑨𝑰-𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘-𝑰𝑰</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="mloMS" id="mloMS" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ufb72268a" id="ufb72268a">🦥</span><span data-lake-id="ue363dc00" id="ue363dc00"> 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐅𝐈𝐄𝐃 𝐅𝐋𝐎𝐖</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u98d422fd" id="u98d422fd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ed1e590" id="u8ed1e590">Rectified Flow：一种用于学习神经常微分方程模型的简洁方法，旨在实现两个经验观测分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f6Tyr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua0d66ba2" id="ua0d66ba2">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FnFiq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2df2b4d" id="uf2df2b4d">之间的传输</span></strong></p><ul list="u4d62aab2"><li fid="uaf835c71" data-lake-id="ue2cc924b" id="ue2cc924b"><span data-lake-id="ub4e3ebde" id="ub4e3ebde">核心思想是学习一个由 ODE 表征的连续时间动力系统，使其诱导的样本演化轨迹尽可能贴近由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XFIqy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15c1877c" id="u15c1877c">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc025087ce2f0895c565e29b45a20382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fVbVL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f5e7ba2" id="u0f5e7ba2">中采样点对所确定的直线路径</span></li><li fid="uaf835c71" data-lake-id="u8f16ed67" id="u8f16ed67"><span data-lake-id="uaacfd00b" id="uaacfd00b">学习目标可被形式化为一个直接的非线性最小二乘优化问题。该优化过程具有良好的可扩展性，能够适用于大规模模型训练，并且无需引入区别于标准监督学习框架的额外参数或复杂训练机制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5924a468" id="u5924a468"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8aee8a2" id="ub8aee8a2">直线路径是连接两个端点的最短路径，并且可在无需时间离散化的情况下被精确模拟，因此能够得到计算效率较高的模型</span></strong></p><ul list="ufb32329a"><li fid="u7f6d2f56" data-lake-id="uc6a68413" id="uc6a68413"><span data-lake-id="ufa2e5fb5" id="ufa2e5fb5">通过从数据中学习 rectified flow，可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OmC3e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u062c4030" id="u062c4030">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GCflx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4f29370" id="ud4f29370">之间的任意耦合有效转化为一个新的确定性耦合，并且该耦合在所有凸传输代价意义下均满足非增性质</span></li><li fid="u7f6d2f56" data-lake-id="u1e57961d" id="u1e57961d"><span data-lake-id="u4cb7a4d1" id="u4cb7a4d1">通过 reflow 的过程，即迭代地利用前一阶段流模型生成的数据训练新的 rectified flow，可以得到一系列轨迹逐渐趋于直线的流模型。由此获得的模型在推理阶段即便采用较粗粒度的时间离散化，也能够被准确模拟</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u94fa7fc3" id="u94fa7fc3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04f11736" id="u04f11736">各类无监督学习面临的共同挑战在于缺乏成对的输入/输出样本，而此类样本通常是标准回归与分类任务得以构建的基础。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4857be3f" id="u4857be3f">许多无监督方法的核心在于，如何在来自不同分布的样本之间建立具有语义意义的对应关系</span></p><ul list="uaf2736ce"><li fid="ud9e31bf0" data-lake-id="uf668bde6" id="uf668bde6"><span data-lake-id="u602551eb" id="u602551eb">生成模型如 GAN 和 VAE，旨在将数据样本映射到服从简单基础分布（如高斯分布）的潜在表示空间中，从而实现数据生成与语义操控</span></li><li fid="ud9e31bf0" data-lake-id="u56fce528" id="u56fce528"><span data-lake-id="u74298555" id="u74298555">领域迁移方法则关注于学习两个经验观测分布之间的映射关系，以支持图像到图像翻译、风格迁移和领域自适应等任务</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3bdf5881" id="u3bdf5881" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778846361514-1ecc6a04-3656-4b56-a8a1-922217ba7031.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u24c55ae2-2546-47ad-a67f-41e035928f8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2362daad-3674-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A766.3636474609375%2C%22height%22%3A76%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A49398%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1194%2C%22originHeight%22%3A119%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EARMINGIRANSPORTMAPPINGGIVENEMPIRICALOBSERVATIONSOFTWODISTRIBUTIONSTN%2CTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A1101%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FNDATRANSPORTMAPT%3AR-RR%2CWHICHINTHEINFNITEDATALIMIT%2CGIVESZ%3DTZN)MWHEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A5%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A1172%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RTO%2CTHATIS.(LO.L)ISACOUPLING(A.K.ATRANSPORTPLAN)OFTOANDT.%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A79%2C%22width%22%3A889%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e7e7e7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u390cfa4c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uac4eb21f" id="uac4eb21f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u226e1697" id="u226e1697">传输映射问题通常不存在唯一解，因为两个分布之间可能存在多个乃至无穷多个可行映射。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud2552cd4" id="ud2552cd4">最优传输进一步要求在所有耦合中寻找使传输代价最小的最优耦合，但在高维生成建模与领域迁移任务中，传输代价往往并非直接优化目标，且精确求解 OT 问题计算困难。因此，更实际的方向是构造一种适用于机器学习任务、具有实际意义且易于优化的放松最优性准则。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u743b22f5" id="u743b22f5">围绕传输映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe653289cfaa7dc2d2b728c1d442d046a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22onq5R%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f7d32e8" id="u2f7d32e8">的建模与训练，主要包括两类</span></strong></p><ul list="u5d72dee0"><li fid="ue373a2af" data-lake-id="u5f9e76bd" id="u5f9e76bd"><span data-lake-id="ub2252b89" id="ub2252b89">传统生成模型，通常将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe653289cfaa7dc2d2b728c1d442d046a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BNscL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub42b21a9" id="ub42b21a9">参数化为神经网络，并通过 GAN 式极小极大优化或近似最大似然估计进行训练。然而，GAN 存在训练不稳定和模式崩溃等问题，而 MLE 在复杂模型中往往难以精确求解，通常需要近似推断或特殊的可计算似然结构</span></li><li fid="ue373a2af" data-lake-id="u84cac5f0" id="u84cac5f0"><span data-lake-id="u66efce54" id="u66efce54">连续时间模型将传输计划隐式表示为 ODE 或 SDE 过程，利用神经网络建模其中的漂移力场，在推理阶段通过数值求解器模拟样本演化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue03a820e" id="ue03a820e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8debed86" id="u8debed86" style="color: #70000D">研究动机： 连续时间模型虽然具有较强的分布建模能力，但推理时需多次调用神经力场，计算成本较高。同时，生成建模与领域迁移通常被分别处理，缺乏统一框架；而最优传输虽可统一二者，却在高维大规模场景下难以有效求解</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3ff85e1f" id="u3ff85e1f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a76cd66" id="u4a76cd66" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">论文贡献：提出 rectified flow，一种简洁的传输映射学习方法，能够在统一框架下处理生成建模与领域迁移任务</span></strong></p><ul list="ue69b1643"><li fid="udb5b04c0" data-lake-id="uee61a377" id="uee61a377"><span data-lake-id="u54bb969d" id="u54bb969d">Rectified flow 是一种 ODE 模型，其目标是通过尽可能沿直线路径演化，将分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uw8YY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09b5fa54" id="u09b5fa54">传输至分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc025087ce2f0895c565e29b45a20382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ng1Jn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9f0ecd6" id="ue9f0ecd6">。直线路径之所以具有重要意义，一方面在于其从理论上构成连接两个端点的最短路径；另一方面，从计算角度看，直线路径可以在无需时间离散化的情况下被精确模拟</span></li><li fid="udb5b04c0" data-lake-id="uac3a88cc" id="uac3a88cc"><span data-lake-id="uf5457380" id="uf5457380" style="color: #000000">rectified flow 通过一个简单、可扩展的无约束最小二乘优化过程进行训练。该过程避免 GAN 训练中的不稳定性问题、MLE 方法中不可 tractable 的似然计算问题，以及去噪扩散模型中复杂而微妙的超参数选择问题。从训练数据中构造 rectified flow 的过程具有如下理论性质</span></li></ul><ul list="ue69b1643" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="udb5b04c0" data-lake-id="u73be368d" id="u73be368d"><span data-lake-id="u9328f878" id="u9328f878" style="color: #000000">该过程能够得到一个新的耦合，并且该耦合对于所有凸代价函数而言均具有非增的传输代价</span></li><li fid="udb5b04c0" data-lake-id="uca0f1f24" id="uca0f1f24"><span data-lake-id="ua72edbf5" id="ua72edbf5" style="color: #000000">该过程能够使流轨迹逐渐趋于直线，从而降低数值求解器所引入的离散化误差</span></li></ul><ul list="ue69b1643" start="3"><li fid="udb5b04c0" data-lake-id="u60c5279b" id="u60c5279b"><span data-lake-id="uece99050" id="uece99050" style="color: #000000">通过 reflow 过程，即迭代地使用前一阶段 rectified flow 模拟得到的数据来训练新的 rectified flow，可以获得轨迹近似直线的流模型</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="yzgWO" id="yzgWO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ud1a96f16" id="ud1a96f16">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u09401299" id="u09401299"> 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐅𝐈𝐄𝐃 𝐅𝐋𝐎𝐖</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u4e047887" id="u4e047887"><span data-lake-id="u534895e5" id="u534895e5">给定来自两个分布的经验观测样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd69dc0f50b053a637457a3326dfb3af.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ngyX1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf49cac92" id="uf49cac92">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_1%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f5db331594133f4fdcbbc2b5cb628d3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GGrz2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc9904a93" id="uc9904a93">，由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2C%20X_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F938ea16e965b74f74ab1f98ed7286bee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wWO3n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u895c01d2" id="u895c01d2">所诱导的 rectified flow 是定义在时间区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F302ac8bbc79818236f95d6cb03777264.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w2cFU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d19881a" id="u4d19881a">上的常微分方程模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7DZ_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%3Dv(Z_t%2Ct).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2830d989d7fa3512e46163c32086706d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c2sb1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d51e6b9" id="u4d51e6b9">其目标是将初始分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F646bf5d2dc258cc21f2d2b9d44904a1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t1tBl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72f5c1c7" id="u72f5c1c7">中的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7efca8234d1b16c711049f2114f49120.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q8sw4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63d2fbe8" id="u63d2fbe8">传输为服从目标分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Civts%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2eaa56e1" id="u2eaa56e1">的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Z_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F734b256ae6a5173972c10d3836f295e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M19Dv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fd48e51" id="u6fd48e51">。漂移力场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%3A%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff00e03ebda40a9c7d80a57a532f5a526.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wrBZh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0efe7bf6" id="u0efe7bf6">被设计为尽可能驱动流沿着从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00f5d6a7abb65413225f0c3f5dfa665c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XS1WM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d396c5f" id="u7d396c5f">指向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94c58d8eb0102881760549f2ac6d724e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZ9z9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6006702" id="ua6006702">的线性路径方向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_1-X_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc76121824525b6890a7a19360b7f88f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mw4P2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub3c3559e" id="ub3c3559e">演化。该目标可通过求解如下简单的最小二乘回归问题实现：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u739f7661" id="u739f7661" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_v%20%5C%5Cint_0%5E1%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C(X_1%20-%20X_0)%20-%20v(X_t%2C%20t)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwith%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20X_t%20%3D%20tX_1%20%2B%20(1%20-%20t)X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F711173672a9b973f1f6b1d8b60ae2c6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pDtSO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u67115d40" id="u67115d40"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01c323799e107c8a57f45129084aa14b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o1NN4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15a1dbd3" id="u15a1dbd3">表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd39fc7a9a7ded1bb38a689ef4a6a311e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SLg50%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u731c182a" id="u731c182a">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94c58d8eb0102881760549f2ac6d724e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Imapp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89eb3506" id="u89eb3506">之间的线性插值。期望</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a1bd1357d8c762680255ec7ff701fbe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22luoLu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f770c20" id="u2f770c20">是关于随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf3639ea244cedd65b318aed32bc85ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Iz0zI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u59117803" id="u59117803">的，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%3DtX_1%2B(1-t)X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F191b2d42a8db4bb67ee56dc071817e86.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lnLYd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7cf2da2" id="uf7cf2da2">视为由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf3639ea244cedd65b318aed32bc85ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x1AbB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8ca794c" id="ud8ca794c">决定的函数。线性插值过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yFX7P%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud478a1d3" id="ud478a1d3">满足一个朴素的 ODE：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9d123ecf" id="u9d123ecf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7DX_t%20%3D%20(X_1%20-%20X_0)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c74c9725ef4afa54f267ad50a051b17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fwQpG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u489a540b" id="u489a540b"><span data-lake-id="u71a96e31" id="u71a96e31">然而该 ODE 并不适合直接用于构造传输映射，因为它是非因果的，或者说具有预知性：对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01c323799e107c8a57f45129084aa14b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22InMQJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua126b46a" id="ua126b46a">的更新依赖于终点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94c58d8eb0102881760549f2ac6d724e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zh4TO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41d20109" id="u41d20109">的信息。Rectified flow 通过拟合漂移场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F315942684b5d24f3d82e8956036a63ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t45zj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufac2d1e7" id="ufac2d1e7">来近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(X_1-X_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda757dd03023b5d9f5411ba8bc8d0bda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AENWh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90c1f48c" id="u90c1f48c">，从而将线性插值路径因果化，得到一个无需预先知道未来终点即可模拟的 ODE 流</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3a5af796" id="u3a5af796"><span data-lake-id="u0a1b6998" id="u0a1b6998">在实践中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M5o53%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1dda20d" id="ua1dda20d">通常由神经网络或其他非线性模型参数化，并使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F047ff9d54dd1ba82bbdec5e8b1ec59b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pQSUx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u626bf1f1" id="u626bf1f1">的经验样本，通过随机梯度下降等通用随机优化方法求解上述目标。获得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uPNVm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uccfa2dfa" id="uccfa2dfa">后，可以从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8754a6870ea410a7e49bafc548b71066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vsn7f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u83395c48" id="u83395c48">出发正向求解 ODE，以实现从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BqebI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube955033" id="ube955033">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eZCL6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udcb0e101" id="udcb0e101">的传输；也可以从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_1%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99d7eed56c06af80e46124e0e63c6431.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bijh8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0db8fc32" id="u0db8fc32">出发反向求解，以实现从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zwf1O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea918072" id="uea918072">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nj53B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64f80f85" id="u64f80f85">的传输</span></p><p data-lake-id="u85181883" id="u85181883"><strong><span data-lake-id="u146a55aa" id="u146a55aa" style="color: #DF2A3F">流避免交叉：对于一个适定的常微分方程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dZ_t%3Dv(Z_t%2Ct)dt%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f18bddc3e05010d6ab4bea8f36bcbd7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C6CFd%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2bc16d8" id="ue2bc16d8" style="color: #DF2A3F">若其解存在且唯一，则不同轨迹在任意时间</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5B0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcd6d335c0f05075e07c1ba0a6432f7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FLAZ1%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9b216a21" id="u9b216a21" style="color: #DF2A3F">上都不能相互交叉</span></strong></p><ul list="ud9c329f5"><li fid="u2d74cacd" data-lake-id="u55d362f2" id="u55d362f2"><span data-lake-id="u55a5d89e" id="u55a5d89e">具体而言，不存在某个位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2dc2f30fdea502d97fe0776b4bf165d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AMqFu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueeff9df6" id="ueeff9df6">和时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5B0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcd6d335c0f05075e07c1ba0a6432f7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BDzPR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cb03479" id="u1cb03479">，使得两条轨迹在该时刻以不同方向经过同一点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wymBM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u554b6bbb" id="u554b6bbb">。否则，该 ODE 在该点的解将不再唯一</span></li><li fid="u2d74cacd" data-lake-id="u6f835e58" id="u6f835e58"><span data-lake-id="u88c6cf69" id="u88c6cf69">可以将线性插值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TZCqa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8656f225" id="u8656f225">理解为在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LS25E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6d2bfe1" id="ue6d2bfe1">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AOBvv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3df25c3c" id="u3df25c3c">之间构建道路或通道，而 rectified flow 则对应于粒子在这些道路上的运动方式。该运动是局部的、无记忆的且非交叉的：它忽略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd39fc7a9a7ded1bb38a689ef4a6a311e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c5c1h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7859282" id="uc7859282">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94c58d8eb0102881760549f2ac6d724e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VHgR7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u062b7766" id="u062b7766">如何在全局上配对的路径信息，并重新构造出一个更具确定性的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vvoC3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc77242f8" id="uc77242f8">配对关系</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufd36c541" id="ufd36c541" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778850610106-8be230a4-f3e3-48ff-8891-6d3b4cf11111.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A828.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A172%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1456%2C%22originHeight%22%3A303%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f2f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jmXtK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf8e55a03" id="uf8e55a03"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaf8d272c" id="uaf8d272c" style="color: #2A4200">Rectified Flow 降低传输代价：若上述最小二乘问题能够被精确求解，则由 rectified flow 得到的样本对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gcvnw%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc61e0cba" id="uc61e0cba" style="color: #2A4200">被保证是</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ds71x%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc1b9bc0" id="ucc1b9bc0" style="color: #2A4200">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc025087ce2f0895c565e29b45a20382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aH4uy%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udeadfca3" id="udeadfca3" style="color: #2A4200">的一个有效耦合，即当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8754a6870ea410a7e49bafc548b71066.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RDdZP%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0cbcfae1" id="u0cbcfae1" style="color: #2A4200"> 时，有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_1%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99d7eed56c06af80e46124e0e63c6431.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z0gGw%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u24453b55" id="u24453b55" style="color: #2A4200">。此外，相较于原始数据对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F047ff9d54dd1ba82bbdec5e8b1ec59b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q04MP%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u20bf9300" id="u20bf9300" style="color: #2A4200">，该耦合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e4f9C%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u759fcb76" id="u759fcb76" style="color: #2A4200">对所有凸代价函数均能保证不产生更大的传输代价</span></strong></p><ul list="u77a8789e"><li fid="u6a872a15" data-lake-id="u6dddfc82" id="u6dddfc82"><span data-lake-id="u6d34b934" id="u6d34b934">原始数据对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf3639ea244cedd65b318aed32bc85ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ik27v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15243fdf" id="u15243fdf">可以是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7053b19253683263264c580d3ea7cffe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22paqc8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u766d8822" id="u766d8822">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k5SxQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u617ca8f9" id="u617ca8f9">之间的任意耦合。在实际问题中，由于通常缺乏有意义的成对观测，它们往往被视为相互独立，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_0%20%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Cpi_1.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F50e573de1416230467a9c486026cca70.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cwF2T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3de23065" id="u3de23065">经过 rectified flow 得到的耦合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S3a9B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c0478b9" id="u4c0478b9">具有确定性依赖关系，因为它由一个 ODE 模型构造得到。记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRectFlow%7D((X_0%2CX_1))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ea0ecdc14fc8126543291dbac9ae34e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AQ6L2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21bbbe08" id="u21bbbe08">表示从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F047ff9d54dd1ba82bbdec5e8b1ec59b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C2fUR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub3371c7e" id="ub3371c7e">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zxuzi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16f514b9" id="u16f514b9">的整流映射。因此</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRectFlow%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22db1e345cb1f81bed982a6fbfd345ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y6iap%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c8a4a58" id="u6c8a4a58">可以将任意耦合转化为一个具有更低凸传输代价的确定性耦合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ea39087" id="u6ea39087" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778851900825-df581d6a-6cc8-49bb-a75f-a881d0fdd00c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf89889f8-ae56-4787-969d-202df67ed4f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc667e995-2cd0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A707.8182373046875%2C%22height%22%3A222%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A114783%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1262%2C%22originHeight%22%3A396%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22INING%3A0%3DARGMINEX1-XO-U(TX1%2B(1-T)XO%2CT)%5C%22%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A761%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFLOW(OPTIONAL)%3AZK%2BL%3DRECTFLOWL(Z%2CZ%E5%8D%88)%2CSTARTINGFROM(ZY%2CZY)%3D(XO%2CX1)%2CWHERE(X0%2CXI%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A1207%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLING%3ADRAW(ZO.ZI)FOLLOWINGDZT%3DOA(ZT%2CT)DTSTARTINGFROMZOTO(ORZ1TI).%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A1060%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISTIL(OPTIONAL)%3ALEARNANEURALNETWORKT%5C%22TODISTILTHEK-RCTIIEDFOW%2CSUCHTHATZT(Z).%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A350%2C%22width%22%3A1105%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUTS%3AVELOCITYMODELUE%3ARRWITHPARAMETER0.%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A639%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETWR%3AZ%3DZT%3ATE0%2C1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A236%2C%22width%22%3A350%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM1RECTIFEDFLOWMAINAGORITHM%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A578%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ISDRAWNFROMOANDT1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A378%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROCEDURE%3AZ%3DRECTF1OW(XO%2CX1))%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A467%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeeeee%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc3243ff4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u13ec255a" id="u13ec255a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8003b0e0" id="u8003b0e0" style="color: #270070">直线流实现快速模拟：记</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRectFlow%7D((X_0%2CX_1))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f5f50f89b56e7c80142efc1edc11080.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yDfLt%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8c478c8" id="ud8c478c8" style="color: #270070">为由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F047ff9d54dd1ba82bbdec5e8b1ec59b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SL8Sr%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0204831c" id="u0204831c" style="color: #270070">诱导得到的 rectified flow。按照算法 1 递归地应用该算子，可以得到一系列 rectified flows</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u89ff2383" id="u89ff2383" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BZ%7D%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRectFlow%7D((Z_0%5Ek%2C%20Z_1%5Ek))%EF%BC%8C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20with%20%7D%20(Z_0%5E0%2C%20Z_1%5E0)%20%3D%20(X_0%2C%20X_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26f2a982396c3de2d25ba6a9b200e00c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sKys8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u42dc2283"><li fid="ud9a68874" data-lake-id="u0d186386" id="u0d186386"><span data-lake-id="u9b94aa68" id="u9b94aa68">该 reflow 过程不仅能够降低传输代价，还具有一个重要作用，即逐步拉直 rectified flow 的轨迹，使流路径更加接近直线</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="PJPGj" id="PJPGj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u964d5c65" id="u964d5c65">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u73167b80" id="u73167b80"> 𝐌𝐀𝐈𝐍 𝐏𝐑𝐎𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐓𝐈𝐄𝐒</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5bc1239d" id="u5bc1239d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u01e8974a" id="u01e8974a" style="color: #70000D">对于给定的输入耦合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf3639ea244cedd65b318aed32bc85ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vDe0O%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u515284e2" id="u515284e2" style="color: #70000D">，最小值在如下情形下取得：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_X(x%2Ct)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5BX_1-X_0%20%5C%5Cmid%20X_t%3Dx%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4114d91f372149a03fa22f726c7d8094.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QyWHy%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb00c784" id="ubb00c784" style="color: #70000D">即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_X(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1e14ad864645875daec337db9753685b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VEork%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e49fdd8" id="u8e49fdd8" style="color: #70000D">表示在时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MKyt2%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6479a578" id="u6479a578" style="color: #70000D">经过位置</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70a0f663ea24f20341612f0479fb18c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NKGGv%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cd2def9" id="u3cd2def9" style="color: #70000D">的线性路径方向</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_1-X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13176b5d914b0b8985f8107eff4959df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DWkZd%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f606509" id="u2f606509" style="color: #70000D">的条件期望。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1851ae8d" id="u1851ae8d">下面讨论由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7DZ_t%20%3D%20v_X(Z_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa488950492ed5827b46a5808b5ef758d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fyV6A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u878df8b5" id="u878df8b5">定义的 rectified flow 的性质，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_0%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8cd1070edc221c60db965bea278d0ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i8LXD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4ad7d979" id="u4ad7d979">，并假设该 ODE 存在唯一解</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1d13e618" id="u1d13e618" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7Bv%5EX(x%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5BX_1%20-%20X_0%20%5C%5Cmid%20X_t%20%3D%20x%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc362e59c297125746575a78b9391060f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P7yuU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u68b78281" id="u68b78281"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubbc08902" id="ubbc08902" style="color: #270070">边缘分布保持性质：样本对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cqGl9%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5aeabdfe" id="u5aeabdfe" style="color: #270070">构成</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F646bf5d2dc258cc21f2d2b9d44904a1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hsW7G%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u87d59f64" id="u87d59f64" style="color: #270070">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dhASe%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uccda7dd1" id="uccda7dd1" style="color: #270070">的一个耦合。并且对任意时间，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe959aa16a2ee5b129544803e06352517.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hHMKY%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f93b327" id="u6f93b327" style="color: #270070">的边缘分布与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eKAms%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u60da03c7" id="u60da03c7" style="color: #270070">的边缘分布相同</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd8c89bf" id="udd8c89bf">，即</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2e5864da" id="u2e5864da" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BLaw%7D(Z_t)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BLaw%7D(X_t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cforall%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a229f0b27a3851d06b75fc1ec2cbe8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xZIVd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4963c901"><li fid="ua436bbef" data-lake-id="ufcdc1e3b" id="ufcdc1e3b"><span data-lake-id="u910a4a86" id="u910a4a86">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01c323799e107c8a57f45129084aa14b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EobDG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4644686" id="ud4644686">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe959aa16a2ee5b129544803e06352517.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BZ7se%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub95e0a16" id="ub95e0a16">的动力学下，任意位置与任意时刻穿过每个无穷小体积元的期望质量流入量和流出量是相同的。因此，二者刻画出相同的边缘分布演化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u21cbc241" id="u21cbc241" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778852839624-52163ae9-c7be-435e-a85f-1952404f2f88.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9b326981-f7f3-43e7-82d6-177749f477f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u36afe88f-714f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A871.2727272727273%2C%22height%22%3A75%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A35254%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1198%2C%22originHeight%22%3A103%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22VTIME%26LOCATION%E4%BB%8ALAW(ZT)-LAW(XT)%2CVT%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A580%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLOWIN%26OUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A325%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A183%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLOWIN%26OUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A4%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f4f4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9e52790b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u55832dbc"><li fid="ua6b8c0e0" data-lake-id="u5f8d87a6" id="u5f8d87a6"><span data-lake-id="u89f77ab6" id="u89f77ab6">从数学上看，通过证明</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yLhBp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c6b64f5" id="u2c6b64f5">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe959aa16a2ee5b129544803e06352517.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K3qQ7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84765d16" id="u84765d16">的边缘分布均满足相同的连续性方程得到：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdot%7B%5C%5Crho%7D_t%2B%5C%5Cnabla%5C%5Ccdot(v_X%5C%5Crho_t)%3D0%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6116b6fc5adc2b964bc013598fccf772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tdPiP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ed3c0ab" id="u1ed3c0ab">因此二者具有相同的边缘分布</span></li><li fid="ua6b8c0e0" data-lake-id="u14f6dfb9" id="u14f6dfb9"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f1e130e073a872f2c50270054eba654.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xzLX1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad679a4b" id="uad679a4b">的整条轨迹的联合分布通常不同于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22unZ8U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe2a2f4a" id="ufe2a2f4a">的轨迹联合分布。特别地，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01c323799e107c8a57f45129084aa14b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RAzg3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18db522a" id="u18db522a">一般是一个非因果、非 Markov 过程，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F047ff9d54dd1ba82bbdec5e8b1ec59b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yDVwa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c97a9d6" id="u7c97a9d6">是随机耦合；而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c3feb604fdfc08a9265c071d7772dd5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vPBqZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b80f1d7" id="u9b80f1d7">则在保持所有时刻边缘分布不变的同时，对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t5Orn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26159d50" id="u26159d50">进行因果化、Markov 化和去随机化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u770adff8" id="u770adff8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u61804e36" id="u61804e36" style="color: #5C0036">降低传输代价：由 rectified flow 得到的耦合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%2CZ_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0c900db563a804bf0e386989486c04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gau2K%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u57052810" id="u57052810" style="color: #5C0036">在任意凸传输代价意义下都不大于输入耦合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf3639ea244cedd65b318aed32bc85ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BUWM0%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cb7c1e7" id="u7cb7c1e7" style="color: #5C0036">，即对于任意凸函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%3A%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc58510bd8f57a1c129574ac526c66bca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JxfCf%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9258c255" id="u9258c255" style="color: #5C0036">均有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5Bc(Z_1-Z_0)%5D%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5Bc(X_1-X_0)%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa9ef6309ed2fa883fca38820946ec6f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zYfX0%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card></p><ul list="u0b67d05f"><li fid="ua1f16f66" data-lake-id="uf705228f" id="uf705228f"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRectFlow%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22db1e345cb1f81bed982a6fbfd345ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mMghg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb594054" id="ubb594054">在所有凸传输代价构成的集合上实现一种 Pareto 下降，而不需要针对某个特定的代价函数进行优化。这一点使其区别于典型的最优传输优化方法；后者通常被明确表述为针对给定代价函数的优化问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf079d56b" id="uf079d56b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778855854242-757be6ff-b922-4f9e-911f-2f4be869726f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u45acfc77-9d99-4f99-9f16-0d5a1bf5b7e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4019e9d8-d3f1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A791.8182373046875%2C%22height%22%3A75%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A43908%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1207%2C%22originHeight%22%3A115%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EZO-Z%3DLENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A2%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A307%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%5BX-X1%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A992%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A217%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%B0LENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A713%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f2f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u15d72707%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub405944d" id="ub405944d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf940a446" id="uf940a446" style="color: #004347">Reflow、轨迹直线化与快速模拟：当递归应用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRectFlow%7D((Z_0%5Ek%2CZ_1%5Ek))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc51d28a9f514c3c99229d87c1bae920f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QlKdK%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7efc8988" id="u7efc8988" style="color: #004347">过程时，随着</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14cb784d07a4234356ce44d06a5b8a3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BrSm0%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u801e976d" id="u801e976d" style="color: #004347">的增大，第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14cb784d07a4234356ce44d06a5b8a3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rz5es%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaaa0ea16" id="uaaa0ea16" style="color: #004347">阶 rectified flow </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa086b04b6cdb56519a1ed4d1d84cc0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gH1n4%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u117bac70" id="u117bac70" style="color: #004347">的路径会逐渐趋于直线，因此在数值上更易于模拟。这种轨迹直线化趋势可以从理论上得到保证</span></strong></p><ul list="uc8857ac4"><li fid="u45d0f48d" data-lake-id="u95dcc23c" id="u95dcc23c"><span data-lake-id="u65269d67" id="u65269d67">具体而言，若一个流</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7DZ_t%20%3D%20v_X(Z_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa488950492ed5827b46a5808b5ef758d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sISfs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8bdbd61" id="uc8bdbd61">几乎处处满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_t%3DtZ_1%2B(1-t)Z_0%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cforall%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c82784829d238db042c986f17bb1caa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S99Qm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud30c0d53" id="ud30c0d53">或者等价地，沿每条轨迹都有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v(Z_t%2Ct)%3DZ_1-Z_0%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bconst%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3840e1a23ca170a0d031d5f59464fe20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a7Cjg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15416576" id="u15416576">则称该流是直线的</span></li><li fid="u45d0f48d" data-lake-id="u58294e4c" id="u58294e4c"><span data-lake-id="ud4211a5c" id="ud4211a5c">此类直线流在计算上非常有吸引力，本质上是一个一步式模型：单步 Euler 更新</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_1%3DZ_0%2Bv(Z_0%2C0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b906975a8d9da8b586f3248c0ae8cc3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YWGyB%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u45d0f48d" data-lake-id="u8366b02f" id="u8366b02f"><span data-lake-id="u14a5b440" id="u14a5b440">线性插值过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%3D%5C%5C%7BX_t%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F685c2fd463dbfa323f4a441613bd1e0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XXvRH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u745755d8" id="u745755d8">按照上述定义是直线的，但它并不是一个因果流，因此在没有同时访问</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F646bf5d2dc258cc21f2d2b9d44904a1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q25c3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7ef8c27" id="ua7ef8c27">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd66c8ed92bf88310116806f317ab78bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kOUEH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88b79bd2" id="u88b79bd2">样本的 oracle 的情况下无法进行模拟。相比之下，使一个因果流</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7DZ_t%20%3D%20v_X(Z_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa488950492ed5827b46a5808b5ef758d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JUSGY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39d4d36c" id="u39d4d36c">成为直线流并非平凡任务。若要实现这一点，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dE740%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube8c61c0" id="ube8c61c0">必须满足无粘 Burgers 方程：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpartial_t%20v%2B(%5C%5Cpartial_z%20v)v%3D0.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2682252fd3276e079a155d5a6be56ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KRUmd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf5802918" id="uf5802918">沿流轨迹有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7Dv(Z_t%2Ct)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cpartial_z%20v(Z_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cdot%7BZ%7D_t%2B%5C%5Cpartial_t%20v(Z_t%2Ct)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cpartial_z%20v(Z_t%2Ct)v(Z_t%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cpartial_t%20v(Z_t%2Ct)%20%3D%200.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb62bb5d1ead5979bdeff6697f7fb8255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OG3pP%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u45d0f48d" data-lake-id="ua5df2c49" id="ua5df2c49"><span data-lake-id="u86b339cc" id="u86b339cc">任意光滑过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%3D%5C%5C%7BZ_t%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00f0cbeb333c68b7f52b2bb631046979.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KQa3H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72c704cb" id="u72c704cb">的直线性可以通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S(Z)%3D%20%5C%5Cint_0%5E1%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20(Z_1-Z_0)-%5C%5Cdot%7BZ%7D_t%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5Ddt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f1793a4366a763514b101369c7866f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Du72Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u081d01ec" id="u081d01ec">量进行度量。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S(Z)%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F479911d41ef032c79cd387e660185d10.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jiNnT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ca9350b" id="u6ca9350b">时，表示过程具有精确直线性。若某个流的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S(Z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09a2753c00b4e6cc1e13e9347b12bfc4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FPubL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud2b69108" id="ud2b69108">较小，则说明其路径近似直线，因此可以使用较少的离散步数通过数值求解器进行准确模拟</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u375d5770" id="u375d5770"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue899efff" id="ue899efff" style="color: #DF2A3F">[Theorem D.7]：令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Z%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34b94fd9a9aa4350a7cc6d2cb998126e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LGGSj%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9d4529f" id="ub9d4529f" style="color: #DF2A3F">表示由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X_0%2CX_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F047ff9d54dd1ba82bbdec5e8b1ec59b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gxz3C%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u31986d9a" id="u31986d9a" style="color: #DF2A3F">诱导得到的第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xTsq6%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub379530f" id="ub379530f" style="color: #DF2A3F">阶 rectified flow，则有</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u738f12c2" id="u738f12c2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7Bk%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CK%5C%5C%7D%7D%20S(Z%5Ek)%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5B%5C%5C%7CX_1-X_0%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5D%7D%7BK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32872efe4f22eca5a3c48408615d9216.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QX2xd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua0562f7e" id="ua0562f7e"><span data-lake-id="u670202c4" id="u670202c4">仅执行一步 reflow 往往就可以得到近似直线的流模型，并且在单步 Euler 模拟下也能取得良好性能。但并不建议执行过多次 reflow，因为这可能导致对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20v_X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5bc25084fe7716eba806d22a11182ca9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yqXc7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60ec05d1" id="u60ec05d1">的估计误差逐步累积</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4de77326" id="u4de77326" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778851825132-822f583c-7b97-46e8-b9c8-e072fa771181.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A718.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A190%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1287%2C%22originHeight%22%3A341%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f6f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XuJlc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u59dee76e" id="u59dee76e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5d9f821" id="ub5d9f821" style="color: #663000">蒸馏：在获得第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14cb784d07a4234356ce44d06a5b8a3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22djEiW%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uafa3fbf2" id="uafa3fbf2" style="color: #663000">阶 rectified flow </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Z%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34b94fd9a9aa4350a7cc6d2cb998126e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zs1HO%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbab9a7f" id="ufbab9a7f" style="color: #663000">之后，可以进一步通过蒸馏提升推理速度。具体而言，可以将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%5Ek%2CZ_1%5Ek)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f7fc8e8a896a1b9450be5f0eb66d17b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nSlsw%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u21451deb" id="u21451deb" style="color: #663000">之间的映射关系蒸馏到一个神经网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Face45e1684debb74a33ae247610f0508.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FXDYu%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cfae6f9" id="u3cfae6f9" style="color: #663000">中，使其无需模拟整个流过程，便可直接由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_0%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0aabb1da28e1ed7051764cf4a3780d1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y459D%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u44d53a96" id="u44d53a96" style="color: #663000">预测</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_1%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7202f12fec65b405b2a3bb805c96be65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AgOiS%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6883dbe9" id="u6883dbe9">。由于此时流轨迹已经近似直线，因此可以被单步更新良好近似，蒸馏过程也能够较为高效地完成。如果取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BT%7D(z_0)%3Dz_0%2Bv(z_0%2C0)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F45d8f1943fd3d03417d8bd67ab7b1735.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rnSN9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucdf49c34" id="ucdf49c34">则用于蒸馏</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa086b04b6cdb56519a1ed4d1d84cc0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xEaxE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb2573c9" id="ueb2573c9">的损失函数为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub70e5b6f" id="ub70e5b6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20(Z_1%5Ek-Z_0%5Ek)-v(Z_0%5Ek%2C0)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23a72f6d34119c406e673920649380cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UJ0gt%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf07cd886"><li fid="ue8da8ae3" data-lake-id="u95b3f9b9" id="u95b3f9b9"><span data-lake-id="u2c61a271" id="u2c61a271">蒸馏旨在忠实近似已有耦合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%5Ek%2CZ_1%5Ek)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f7fc8e8a896a1b9450be5f0eb66d17b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sH5AK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5327175" id="ud5327175">，而 rectification 则会产生一个新的耦合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(Z_0%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D%2CZ_1%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77f7873cd47cedbe8c99f1fa9ae1fa74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jygoo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d356ab0" id="u2d356ab0">并使其具有更低的传输代价和更直的流轨迹。因此，蒸馏应仅在最终阶段使用，用于将模型微调为一步推理形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u590f47d1" id="u590f47d1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7d155585" id="u7d155585" style="color: #AE146E">非线性 Rectified Flow 及相关方法：本文方法可以扩展为一种简单而具有高度一般性的非线性 rectified flow。该方法允许在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00f5d6a7abb65413225f0c3f5dfa665c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DxPYR%22%7D" style="color: #AE146E"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9445baf" id="ud9445baf" style="color: #AE146E">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd250caa1d05722b0bacbec0a3cafa676.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U5l1u%22%7D" style="color: #AE146E"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u10b6107f" id="u10b6107f" style="color: #AE146E">之间使用任意光滑插值曲线</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qiyK5%22%7D" style="color: #AE146E"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf51a5df1" id="uf51a5df1" style="color: #AE146E">，并采用如下训练损失：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cint_0%5E1%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cdot%7BX%7D_t-v(X_t%2Ct)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5Ddt.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f494b04fdcc090602f95d112664f611.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Go0me%22%7D" style="color: #AE146E"></card><span data-lake-id="u761aaeea" id="u761aaeea">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdot%7BX%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cpartial_t%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ba87d67148a2dca5ca12e76a92feb79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EntHa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub6b6b2ec" id="ub6b6b2ec">表示时间导数。一类自然的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97cdb8eecb0e09e65a7f76c3d2abf078.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bKJpf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue934495f" id="ue934495f">形式为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%20X_1%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%20X_0%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1ca20d19255a4da4bee22d43a43893c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FnJiF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4bfa86d8" id="u4bfa86d8">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65a5c2819f5d0ac391cb7ddd1f21cd9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jy8Kh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf15eade9" id="uf15eade9">为某些时间相关序列，并满足近似边界条件：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf98f74c1" id="uf98f74c1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_1%3D%5C%5Cbeta_0%3D1%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Calpha_0%3D%5C%5Cbeta_1%3D0.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d531914b7f8153669d25638ec6a28f7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pin15%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u37a4d765" id="u37a4d765"><span data-lake-id="u0691d711" id="u0691d711">该类形式包含 probability flow ODEs 和 DDIM 作为特例。根据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65a5c2819f5d0ac391cb7ddd1f21cd9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZNywH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uef96a425" id="uef96a425">的不同选择，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01c323799e107c8a57f45129084aa14b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J5NBX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5c7fe91" id="uc5c7fe91">可能并不具有直线轨迹，因此即便执行 reflow，也未必能够得到直线流</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="xJ4Rm" id="xJ4Rm" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7b4521f4" id="u7b4521f4">🎅</span><span data-lake-id="u2a8949a5" id="u2a8949a5"> 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u1984c6a5" id="u1984c6a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u82075c53" id="u82075c53" style="color: #70000D">生成模型的核心任务，是学习如何将一个易于采样的简单分布逐步变换为复杂的数据分布</span></strong></p><ul list="udfefced3"><li fid="uf512ab90" data-lake-id="u83eed813" id="u83eed813"><span data-lake-id="u996d6882" id="u996d6882">现有方法中，扩散模型之所以取得成功，很大程度上得益于其稳定且可扩展的训练方式：通过逐步向数据中注入噪声，将数据分布平滑地推向简单先验分布，再学习对应的逆过程，从噪声恢复出数据样本</span></li><li fid="uf512ab90" data-lake-id="u77c0811d" id="u77c0811d"><span data-lake-id="u6701579c" id="u6701579c">扩散模型通常受限于预先设定的扩散过程，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6a043cd" id="ue6a043cd">其概率路径形式相对固定</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u67e448ee" id="u67e448ee">，不仅限制建模灵活性，也往往导致训练和采样代价较高</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf2c65129" id="uf2c65129"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5a07098" id="ud5a07098" style="color: #70000D">连续归一化流（Continuous Normalizing Flows, CNFs）提供一个更一般的生成建模框架</span></strong></p><ul list="u269ef4ec"><li fid="u765f99f1" data-lake-id="uff7e8903" id="uff7e8903"><span data-lake-id="u8f44b718" id="u8f44b718">CNF 可以描述任意连续概率路径，从理论上比扩散模型更灵活，并且扩散过程本身也可以被视为其中的特例。然而，CNF 的训练长期面临可扩展性不足的问题：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5fa35d7d" id="u5fa35d7d">传统最大似然训练通常依赖数值 ODE 仿真，计算开销大</span></strong></li><li fid="u765f99f1" data-lake-id="ub00f5ebc" id="ub00f5ebc"><span data-lake-id="ub795f503" id="ub795f503">已有的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7741d35f" id="u7741d35f">simulation-free</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0cd8ce94" id="u0cd8ce94"> 训练方法又常常</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6f15bc0" id="ub6f15bc0">存在积分不可解或梯度有偏</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u130603c6" id="u130603c6">等问题。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5c2c33a" id="ub5c2c33a" style="color: #2A4200">因此，如何在保持 CNF 灵活性的同时，实现像扩散模型那样高效稳定的大规模训练，成为一个关键问题</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf4b8fff4" id="uf4b8fff4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4384402f" id="u4384402f" style="color: #70000D">论文提出 Flow Matching（FM）框架。这是一种 simulation-free 的 CNF 训练方法，其核心思想是：不再通过昂贵的轨迹求解来优化模型，而是直接让模型去回归一个能够生成目标概率路径的向量场。具体而言，作者考虑一类从噪声分布到数据分布的条件概率路径，并将训练目标转化为对这些路径对应速度场的匹配问题。CNF 的训练就不再依赖复杂的 ODE 数值模拟，而可以像监督学习一样直接进行优化</span></strong></p><ul list="u56e617be"><li fid="u50f9c241" data-lake-id="ud67d83ed" id="ud67d83ed"><strong><span data-lake-id="udb56e55e" id="udb56e55e">提出 Conditional Flow Matching（CFM）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uce81d9ee" id="uce81d9ee">虽然全局目标向量场通常难以直接计算，但可以通过逐样本的条件路径构造出等价的训练目标。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5467137a" id="u5467137a" style="color: #270070">模型并不需要显式知道难处理的整体流场，只需在样本级别上学习条件向量场，就能够获得与原始目标一致的梯度信号</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ued66305e" id="ued66305e">。这一点使得 Flow Matching 真正具备可实现性，也构成该方法能够扩展到大规模训练场景的核心基础</span></li><li fid="u50f9c241" data-lake-id="ucc49ccb0" id="ucc49ccb0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8b72eba" id="ud8b72eba" style="color: #270070">FM 并不局限于某一种特定路径，而是兼容一类通用的高斯概率路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucf7cada8" id="ucf7cada8">。在这一框架下，现有扩散模型所采用的路径只是其中的一个特例。Flow Matching 一方面能够覆盖已有扩散模型的训练方式；另一方面，也为探索扩散之外的其他概率路径提供统一框架。即使仅在扩散路径上使用 FM，相比传统</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u99129312" id="u99129312">得分匹配方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u731f82fe" id="u731f82fe">，也能够获得更加稳健、更加稳定的训练效果</span></li><li fid="u50f9c241" data-lake-id="u06a9db5d" id="u06a9db5d"><span data-lake-id="u3ba623fd" id="u3ba623fd">它允许直接采用非扩散型概率路径来训练生成模型。其中最有代表性的例子，就是基于最优传输（Optimal Transport, OT）位移插值构造条件概率路径。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f738b2e" id="u3f738b2e" style="color: #270070">与扩散路径相比，OT 路径通常更加简单，其样本轨迹更接近直线，而不是扩散过程中常见的弯曲轨迹</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf8d9a3f5" id="uf8d9a3f5">。作者认为，这种更简洁的几何结构能够有效降低学习难度，并在经验上转化为更快的训练速度、更快的采样过程以及更好的泛化能力</span></li><li fid="u50f9c241" data-lake-id="u3221a680" id="u3221a680"><span data-lake-id="ucfae5121" id="ucfae5121">实验结果表明，使用 Flow Matching 训练得到的 CNF 模型，在样本质量和似然估计两个方面都能够稳定优于一系列基于扩散的替代方法；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e93cc27" id="u6e93cc27" style="color: #270070">由于模型本身是连续时间动力系统，还可以直接结合现成的数值 ODE 求解器，实现快速且可靠的样本生成，在计算开销与生成性能之间取得更好的平衡</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="hvinq" id="hvinq" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7fb0eeb7" id="u7fb0eeb7">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="ue8c13e40" id="ue8c13e40"> 𝑷𝒓𝒆𝒍𝒊𝒎𝒊𝒏𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒆𝒔: 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒕𝒊𝒏𝒖𝒐𝒖𝒔 𝑵𝒐𝒓𝒎𝒂𝒍𝒊𝒛𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u26a649b6" id="u26a649b6"><span data-lake-id="ud440e946" id="ud440e946">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F088e88426d1c834283e0dfc6763110a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pn2l8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u75d97ef4" id="u75d97ef4">表示数据空间，其中数据点记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%3D(x_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Cx_d)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6426f90d10f04d6f916092b4043c3f3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XbCnX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09cc8d86" id="u09cc8d86">。两个重要对象：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d22e743" id="u4d22e743">其一是概率密度路径</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%3A%5B0%2C1%5D%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7bbb42f457398853b9a1ebcf31a698f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HVg2n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud64a2160" id="ud64a2160">它表示一个关于时间变化的概率密度函数，即满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cint%20p_t(x)%5C%5C%2Cdx%20%3D%201%3B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79f6e240a2b81b68941e3a7ffc122eee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xJp7u%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue43387f9" id="ue43387f9">其二是一个随时间变化的向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%3A%5B0%2C1%5D%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1456f787b60b484906c08978c455c890.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Usjl8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufcd9aa6f" id="ufcd9aa6f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2e7d0f3" id="ue2e7d0f3" style="color: #663000">一个向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ki85z%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u943a0c86" id="u943a0c86" style="color: #663000">可以用来构造一个关于时间变化的微分同胚映射，称为流（flow）</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue40135e7" id="ue40135e7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%3A%5B0%2C1%5D%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff83eeebb7d76bc8104045e4ae19f66f0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UhgWm%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ube62ae22" id="ube62ae22"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1b1dfa4" id="ud1b1dfa4">其定义满足如下常微分方程（ODE）：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3ec18f66" id="u3ec18f66" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%5C%5Cphi_t(x)%20%3D%20v_t(%5C%5Cphi_t(x))%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cphi_0(x)%20%3D%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F42294d381f8cb6643793e3fe3ab5968d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gVCkn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1588cf3f" id="u1588cf3f"><span data-lake-id="u9659c26c" id="u9659c26c">此前，Chen 等人（2018）提出使用神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t(x%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7508826e07f8abca32ede5192f2cca29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JRL35%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00106699" id="u00106699">对向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JSTi6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b8efe92" id="u5b8efe92">进行建模，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ep%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc0f5b96e673795bb3c1828ede61c2236.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hMKgR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u691da0bd" id="u691da0bd">表示可学习参数。由此可以得到一个对流映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8916c2173896c95404bd9f896cff28ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rP333%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u87384212" id="u87384212">的深度参数化模型，称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua310d3e9" id="ua310d3e9">连续归一化流</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6e9a755e" id="u6e9a755e">（Continuous Normalizing Flow, CNF）。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uedf61ef8" id="uedf61ef8" style="color: #663000">CNF 的作用是通过如下推前（push-forward）关系，将一个简单的先验密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MU4Y5%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud36abf4e" id="ud36abf4e" style="color: #663000">变换为一个更复杂的密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F091a44b6adf69464fa153ab4fb6b1d64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CwQMV%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u38ed7769" id="u38ed7769" style="color: #663000">：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ueba28bad" id="ueba28bad" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%3D%5B%5C%5Cphi_t%5D_*p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad4b5a5caa5b4d56bb7deee69a867475.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kZCAA%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua2f4fdcd" id="ua2f4fdcd"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9f44662" id="ud9f44662">其中，推前算子（或变量替换算子）定义为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u52e2bde5" id="u52e2bde5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cphi_t%5D_*p_0(x)%3Dp_0(%5C%5Cphi_t%5E%7B-1%7D(x))%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cphi_t%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20x%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F077a2bc1e947760f38afb682dfb4a294.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pDvNc%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue01610f1" id="ue01610f1"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea0a1005" id="uea0a1005">如果一个向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M1k9r%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u98fd5731" id="u98fd5731">的流</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8916c2173896c95404bd9f896cff28ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OKs8q%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d713431" id="u4d713431">满足式</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%3D%5B%5C%5Cphi_t%5D_*p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad4b5a5caa5b4d56bb7deee69a867475.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x2ZrY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u111725f1" id="u111725f1">，则称该向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xabVl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3c4bf51" id="uf3c4bf51">生成概率密度路径</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w7bDI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc89f4f5c" id="uc89f4f5c">。在实践中，判断一个向量场是否生成某条概率路径的一种有效方法，是利用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubfbc2ad2" id="ubfbc2ad2">连续性方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u78454ebf" id="u78454ebf">（continuity equation）</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="ZOkhB" id="ZOkhB" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9274f6c7" id="u9274f6c7">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="u3ab6d618" id="u3ab6d618"> 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘 𝑴𝒂𝒕𝒄𝒉𝒊𝒏𝒈</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8217a64e" id="u8217a64e"><span data-lake-id="ufdf25fd6" id="ufdf25fd6">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QM6hf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74466036" id="u74466036">表示一个服从未知数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86c5ed37dad6fc47429873e76b068f84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o3SPt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76522587" id="u76522587">的随机变量。假设只能获得来自</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86c5ed37dad6fc47429873e76b068f84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zyw3p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02b33cce" id="u02b33cce">的数据样本，而无法直接访问其概率密度函数本身。进一步地，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dXbvt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17e4cffb" id="u17e4cffb">表示一条概率路径，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%3Dp%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feae5c75768ab15f5e5feef5312c2c2d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eAuCr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua55dc688" id="ua55dc688">是一个简单分布，例如标准正态分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%200%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2cb73c943b07efef5d57b8e6dc0cc719.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iGFXA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0a2c9b02" id="u0a2c9b02">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4bacbdff" id="u4bacbdff">并令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F091a44b6adf69464fa153ab4fb6b1d64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w0uDg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2c10e090" id="u2c10e090">在分布意义上近似等于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bZ5EC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd1a6df1" id="ucd1a6df1">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u322329da" id="u322329da">Flow Matching 的目标即被设计为匹配这条目标概率路径，从而能够实现从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HiHdJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u52209142" id="u52209142">到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F091a44b6adf69464fa153ab4fb6b1d64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aTrym%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1992e9e" id="ud1992e9e">的流动</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uee26774e" id="uee26774e"><span data-lake-id="u138bc0c9" id="u138bc0c9">给定目标概率密度路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09bd2c850203216a70dc493f1f7ecd6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mH56M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76d36a49" id="u76d36a49">及其对应的、能够生成该路径的向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0262f300a6821b8b7d9beb257a88250a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hZMuy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f7619f8" id="u9f7619f8">，将 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u806eeb72" id="u806eeb72">Flow Matching（FM）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud9308703" id="ud9308703"> 目标定义为</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc4370558" id="uc4370558" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BFM%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%5C%5C%2Cp_t(x)%7D%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)-u_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F603e2c5c919a6c8d56f740d1d30764e9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JEF4g%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u58f24c7e" id="u58f24c7e"><span data-lake-id="ua1f56bb1" id="ua1f56bb1">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uhloR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99f46711" id="u99f46711">表示 CNF 向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VKMUc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70b6d652" id="u70b6d652">的可学习参数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Csim%20U%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fee7f871bd4b41bf1555aec78d93c1be8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yAdMq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69178a1f" id="u69178a1f">表示时间变量服从区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12d16d9672fe55e37279ae7043b605de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s3JPm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u008b2d90" id="u008b2d90">上的均匀分布，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa4cdb5f8fb490738f84465b6a720ba1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ORbFr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc0bf35e" id="udc0bf35e">。简而言之，FM 损失的本质是利用神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fRq2E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub745345e" id="ub745345e">去回归目标向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22agPh7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u22d28ef5" id="u22d28ef5">。当该损失达到零时，所学习得到的 CNF 模型将能够生成概率路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09bd2c850203216a70dc493f1f7ecd6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KyVjR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5baa1d4a" id="u5baa1d4a"><span data-lake-id="uc8a78874" id="uc8a78874">Flow Matching 是一个简单且颇具吸引力的目标函数。然而，若直接朴素地使用，它在实践中往往是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23670823" id="u23670823">不可处理的</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2d643519" id="u2d643519">。其原因在于，事先并不知道什么样的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf87398453728bdcc1261ede21e68aa3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZKRJY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0811836" id="ue0811836">和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OlXXy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub230d10d" id="ub230d10d">才是合适的选择。首先，满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1(x)%5C%5Capprox%20q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff9a6f2af3773a6333cea8a281e4d5229.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KoZeC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud27d231c" id="ud27d231c">的概率路径并不唯一，存在许多可能的构造方式；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue66454a3" id="ue66454a3" style="color: #663000">更为重要的是，在一般情况下，无法得到一个能够生成目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cvjLu%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3ce4fe6" id="ub3ce4fe6" style="color: #663000">的闭式向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22InUf6%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card></p><card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PVpyb%22%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u0b67fb94" id="u0b67fb94"><strong><span data-lake-id="u049b7a84" id="u049b7a84">构造目标概率路径的一种简单方式，是将若干更简单的概率路径进行混合</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2cfc1fcd" id="u2cfc1fcd">。具体而言，给定一个特定的数据样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nmq7G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf11f927" id="ubf11f927">，记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c1cc58d8983c0bf751a86036ffca9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rQ7HL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe4b50c0" id="ufe4b50c0">为一条条件概率路径，并要求其在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Elc56%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01cadac6" id="u01cadac6">时满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3Dp(x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5be368fdd9e04c81d5184d56ae503a5e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pvXAp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u980e1fc1" id="u980e1fc1">即初始时刻退化为简单先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a43d844d20cf8c9a4edce9ccb6c442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y29Js%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u65a02ede" id="u65a02ede">。同时将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C72FV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf1c2eaac" id="uf1c2eaac">时的条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29024929e4df2ebdc13fc9d05050e73.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qv9Fx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0b41dba" id="uc0b41dba">设计为一个集中于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%3Dx_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77021feaa5b89bd9d34d10debc588d07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RmoH1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue074b1cf" id="ue074b1cf">附近的分布，例如</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20I)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8371f77c42a8f5e00a0d7d0ffc379a59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DucTr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u527bbe5a" id="u527bbe5a">即均值为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mbLLO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3ae73bb" id="ud3ae73bb">、标准差为足够小的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc76ebfad44ce6b4748b32a6571abc199.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ovf5Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f69f940" id="u2f69f940">的高斯分布。对这些条件概率路径关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86c5ed37dad6fc47429873e76b068f84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ft7a2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76157354" id="u76157354">进行边缘化，可以得到边缘概率路径</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7a7f19ec" id="u7a7f19ec" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)q(x_1)%5C%5C%2Cdx_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19cf77c5fb4e06320d621f6c255df1f0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cqhmg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud7784055" id="ud7784055"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1fac89a1" id="u1fac89a1">特别地，在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oLKKW%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubfc6a477" id="ubfc6a477">时，边缘分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F091a44b6adf69464fa153ab4fb6b1d64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iYLwP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa973829" id="uaa973829">成为一个混合分布，并能够较好地逼近数据分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u57ee316c" id="u57ee316c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1(x)%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_1(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)q(x_1)%5C%5C%2Cdx_1%20%5C%5Capprox%20q(x).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd90f257a82afc8f423c8d398cb7b8a12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c2pBG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u92bde637" id="u92bde637"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c161253" id="u7c161253">有趣的是还可以通过对条件向量场进行边缘化来定义一个边缘向量场，其形式如下</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc59c9622" id="uc59c9622">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="uad41eccb" id="uad41eccb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x)%3D%5C%5Cint%20u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)q(x_1)%7D%7Bp_t(x)%7D%5C%5C%2Cdx_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e3e3ad990204bbd2a4b7f6d5310a827.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q1H2f%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9681df34" id="u9681df34"><span data-lake-id="u0b4a586e" id="u0b4a586e">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3A%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5fc8a804f67be01916c9e4496c711b21.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ilgJX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88ac8bba" id="u88ac8bba">表示生成条件概率路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab87fa761993c78091a7f32dc9cb4619.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ncjrb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc57f2242" id="uc57f2242">的条件向量场。尽管这种条件向量场的聚合方式在形式上并不直观，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7bfa6363" id="u7bfa6363" style="color: #2A4200">但是论文证明由此得到的聚合向量场正是刻画边缘概率路径的正确向量场</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7283296f" id="u7283296f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775804206791-cf3e296e-71ff-4313-9c95-1a0c9fafedbf.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u94458a59-65ba-4d5d-af17-802816108bc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1819722e-2a21-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A856%2C%22height%22%3A287%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A155864%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1670%2C%22originHeight%22%3A559%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GIVENVECTORFELDSULOLA)THATGENERUTECONDTIONALPROBABILITYPUATHSP(ALA)%2CFORAYDISTRIBUTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A1535%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G(M)%2CTHEMARGINALVECTORFIELDUUT(R)-%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A600%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ULSLS)TLDAGENERATESTHEMAROINALROB.%22%2C%22x%22%3A644%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A960%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MARGINALVECTORFIELD%22%2C%22x%22%3A269%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A440%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I.E.%2CUTANDPSATISFTHECONTINUITYEQUATION-%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A498%2C%22width%22%3A707%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2CP(W)%E5%8D%81DIVP(R)UT(R))%3D0.%22%2C%22x%22%3A753%2C%22y%22%3A500%2C%22width%22%3A487%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D(RRI)G(R)DXI%22%2C%22x%22%3A733%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A347%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BILITYPATH%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHEOREMM%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P()%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A586%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTRRDRIGEE%22%2C%22x%22%3A677%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A565%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PI(3)%22%2C%22x%22%3A936%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0.0061%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d3cfc3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u80abb6a2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id="uae828b91" id="uae828b91"><p data-lake-id="udd37ab8c" id="udd37ab8c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e0804cf" id="u4e0804cf" style="color: #101E60">𝓞𝓫𝓼𝓮𝓻𝓿𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷：由条件向量场加权聚合得到的边缘向量场，能够生成由条件概率路径边缘化所得的边缘概率路径。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9c375fa4" id="u9c375fa4">原本难以直接刻画的边缘向量场，可以分解为一组仅依赖于单个样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vph2p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc9e9d0f" id="ubc9e9d0f">的条件向量场，再通过对这些条件向量场进行适当聚合，恢复出对应于整体边缘概率路径的生成动力学。由于条件向量场仅与单个数据样本相关，因此其构造和分析通常显著简于直接处理整体边缘向量场</span></p></blockquote><card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LLIpU%22%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ub99e8162" id="ub99e8162"><span data-lake-id="u55f15c5f" id="u55f15c5f">由于边缘概率路径与边缘向量场的定义中均包含难以处理的积分项，边缘向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C76hd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d96e61c" id="u6d96e61c">仍然无法被直接有效计算。因此，若仍然沿用原始的 Flow Matching 目标，就无法朴素地构造其无偏估计量。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf414c8a1" id="uf414c8a1" style="color: #DF2A3F">作者转而提出一个更为简单的替代目标，该目标与原始目标具有相同的最优解。考虑如下的 Conditional Flow Matching（CFM） 目标：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u36184568" id="u36184568" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCFM%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%5C%5C%3Bq(x_1)%2C%5C%5C%3Bp_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)-u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a7ac0b52e19330525c33b6fb2de4b38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Da3Ow%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7aee7080" id="u7aee7080"><span data-lake-id="u36b610f3" id="u36b610f3">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Csim%20U%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fee7f871bd4b41bf1555aec78d93c1be8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yhfsa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea6c4ffe" id="uea6c4ffe">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%5C%5Csim%20q(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F33fa384eca6a570829c65316b4f781d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sd8KP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01a11017" id="u01a11017">，而此时</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d86efe3c416abe3f7290fed973d0039.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tFMGl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48a31191" id="u48a31191">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u841179fd" id="u841179fd">与原始 FM 目标不同，CFM 目标允许我们方便地构造其无偏估计，只要能够高效地从条件概率路径</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c1cc58d8983c0bf751a86036ffca9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LD9Ts%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubc6e9ecc" id="ubc6e9ecc">中采样，并计算条件向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22fcbb3c2f70f72f94b9ab2a5e06f9e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E9GNe%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ff6ce56" id="u8ff6ce56">。而这两点都是容易实现的，因为它们均是在单样本层面定义的对象</span></strong></p><blockquote data-lake-id="uf5ec60c1" id="uf5ec60c1"><p data-lake-id="u687ef693" id="u687ef693"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c2d7843" id="u7c2d7843" style="color: #101E60">𝓞𝓫𝓼𝓮𝓻𝓿𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷：FM 目标与 CFM 目标关于参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NiIdX%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc767814f" id="uc767814f" style="color: #101E60">的梯度完全一致。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8f7ea40f" id="u8f7ea40f">也就是说，从期望意义上看，优化 CFM 目标与优化原始 FM 目标是等价的。由此便可在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u16d7b0ca" id="u16d7b0ca">无需显式获得边缘概率路径</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VUetS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25b5e100" id="u25b5e100">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u216a305e" id="u216a305e">无需计算边缘向量场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qDemx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub974fc46" id="ub974fc46">的前提下，训练一个 CNF 来生成边缘概率路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GbqDo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77b7f123" id="u77b7f123">。特别地在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fi06C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf9e3939a" id="uf9e3939a">时，该边缘概率路径能够逼近未知数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wY3v5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09cc91fb" id="u09cc91fb">。因此，在实际训练中，所需要做的仅仅是设计合适的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u298c07b3" id="u298c07b3">条件概率路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u43beb7b7" id="u43beb7b7">及其对应的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d4abd52" id="u9d4abd52">条件向量场</span></strong></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id="u31825af5" id="u31825af5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775803791909-3fc4ced1-6e97-4abb-8b6e-dd1d9088a236.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ude2623c0-f0e6-477f-9de4-3ded335696a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9d6e0281-1c4e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A913.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A176%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A90588%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1672%2C%22originHeight%22%3A322%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ASSUMINGTHUATP%2C(A)%3E0FORALL2E%5C%22ANDTE0%2C1%2CTHEN%2CUPTOACONSTANTINDEPENDENTOF0%2CCMN%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A1537%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEOREN2(CFMFMGRADIENTEQUIVALENCE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A814%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDLFMAREEQUAL.HENCE%2CVOLRM(0-VOLCRM(0).%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A806%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.003%2C0.0158%2C0.997%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23aab7c0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2c935d8d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="or4My" id="or4My" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0f864e0e" id="u0f864e0e">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="u84394e1e" id="u84394e1e"> 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑫𝑰𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵𝑨𝑳 𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑩𝑨𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑰𝑻𝒀 𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑯𝑺 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑽𝑬𝑪𝑻𝑶𝑹 𝑭𝑰𝑬𝑳𝑫𝑺</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u348ed4ea" id="u348ed4ea"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud18bcd23" id="ud18bcd23">Conditional Flow Matching 目标适用任意形式的条件概率路径与条件向量场。对于一类一般性的高斯条件概率路径，如何构造</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c1cc58d8983c0bf751a86036ffca9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EUMn3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7865aa4" id="ua7865aa4">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22fcbb3c2f70f72f94b9ab2a5e06f9e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zG6xf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fb23635" id="u6fb23635">。具体而言，考虑如下形式的条件概率路径：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub034e248" id="ub034e248" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(x%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1)%2C%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%5E2%20I%5C%5Cbigr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52c3221cd586bc3163fe6f4c1fb522f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i12So%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue19f94c5"><li fid="u396bbeb6" data-lake-id="u94782f82" id="u94782f82"><span data-lake-id="u81921325" id="u81921325">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%3A%5B0%2C1%5D%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a94f6aced79783f1c7ee3330f65b07c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nblro%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77031737" id="u77031737">表示高斯分布随时间变化的均值函数，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%3A%5B0%2C1%5D%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94bbd7169a0d421d2cc3fadb15c42354.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sdb2r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50aaa938" id="u50aaa938">表示随时间变化的标量标准差函数。 并令均值函数与方差函数满足</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua95401fa" id="ua95401fa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgather*%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmu_0(x_1)%20%3D%200%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_0(x_1)%20%3D%201%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmu_1(x_1)%20%3D%20x_1%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_1(x_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%20%5C%5Cll%201.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgather*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff3a17f4e72c10e6abfa7f348d0513660.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JVAMt%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7f61086f"><li fid="u511f9032" data-lake-id="u1a3ab57d" id="u1a3ab57d"><span data-lake-id="u87a99313" id="u87a99313">于是对应地有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uff3beb55" id="uff3beb55" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgather*%7D%5Cnp_0(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%20%5C%5Cmid%200%2C%20I)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnp_1(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5E2%20I).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgather*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89db0bf1e85f3b9c579d81404510b3da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MNepD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u324846c0" id="u324846c0"><span data-lake-id="u9001244e" id="u9001244e">对于任意给定的概率路径，能够生成该路径的向量场并非唯一。事实上，通过在连续性方程中加入一个散度为零的分量，即可得到无穷多个不同的向量场。然而，这些向量场中绝大多数差异，本质上都来自那些</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u22066ba3" id="u22066ba3">不会改变底层分布本身</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4677b568" id="u4677b568">的分量。例如，当分布具有旋转不变性时，额外加入旋转分量并不会改变其概率分布，却会带来不必要的额外计算开销</span></p><ul list="uc667ff33"><li fid="u18813f2c" data-lake-id="u88765a05" id="u88765a05"><span data-lake-id="u5f8e6157" id="u5f8e6157">作者选择采用与高斯分布的一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7dd84dba" id="u7dd84dba">规范变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf2541dd9" id="uf2541dd9">（canonical transformation）相对应的、最为简单的向量场。具体地，考虑如下在条件</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e8831d88c93179dbe6c8b5e3678ca20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RAdF3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc66e64c" id="ucc66e64c">下定义的流映射：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uddf56665" id="uddf56665" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%3D%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)x%2B%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F182fd4451453c12cf943284086310ba4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zkx7o%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u16355690" id="u16355690"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52c89190" id="u52c89190" style="color: #270070">当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vX5yG%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b21d535" id="u0b21d535" style="color: #270070">服从标准高斯分布时，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe814ac84bc525fb5d50caaf1acff519b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E8J90%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u65767db2" id="u65767db2" style="color: #270070">正是一个仿射变换，它能够将标准高斯随机变量映射为一个均值为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcba5491bfa79cd31e373a9ad86808204.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mCycC%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u72470bd3" id="u72470bd3" style="color: #270070">、标准差为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb6a255eae35327783cfcbff2981ece8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Eo4yM%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u40d62ba0" id="u40d62ba0" style="color: #270070">的高斯随机变量。</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8101877e2e4931888f0c6805b345e501.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zPE3P%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u99f7a2e4" id="u99f7a2e4" style="color: #270070">能够将噪声分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3Dp(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d5332be853bd9c205c94c45e4b9dbd1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UjlMX%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3809189b" id="u3809189b" style="color: #270070">推送到条件概率路径</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c1cc58d8983c0bf751a86036ffca9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ms8Uy%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5c969e3" id="ub5c969e3" style="color: #270070">，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cpsi_t%5D_*p(x)%3Dp_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5a955901b7f52708f153b9b43415368.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FJ5TZ%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card></p><ul list="u93f3b882"><li fid="u43d14dc6" data-lake-id="u44f147f8" id="u44f147f8"><span data-lake-id="u6cf41b78" id="u6cf41b78">由条件仿射流</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%3D%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)x%2B%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F917c3bb5134ce04f6420c4baf5f3c8dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qSt8x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6dd8f4cf" id="u6dd8f4cf">可知，条件样本的演化由对应向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22fcbb3c2f70f72f94b9ab2a5e06f9e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wIXKm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u363f8707" id="u363f8707">所驱动，并满足</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udf39ad51" id="udf39ad51" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%3Du_t(%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%5C%5Cmid%20x_1).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4849f8ce5c6f6acf5d8b241b58faeff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dp5Bz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2615f759"><li fid="u55d18d36" data-lake-id="ud4cfd12e" id="ud4cfd12e"><span data-lake-id="u4aed3b87" id="u4aed3b87">进一步地，将条件路径写成对初始噪声变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%5C%5Csim%20p(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ce3be4a99e6d6a64003f6ba17a407c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WSRnw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub651121b" id="ub651121b">的重参数化形式，并代入 Conditional Flow Matching 目标，可将训练过程写为对网络向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dZrtf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e4d00c7" id="u1e4d00c7">与真实条件速度场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%5C%5Cpsi_t(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77df343289e2d43e3e8d3ec15b1bbda4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YXAzV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f931164" id="u4f931164">之间的平方误差回归</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u28e4b876" id="u28e4b876" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BCFM%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%20q(x_1)%2C%20p(x_0)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20v_t(%5C%5Cpsi_t(x_0))%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%5C%5Cpsi_t(x_0)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba9ddbbd3b1fe5e39be473f6c5102132.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZhvOe%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u045e9e83" id="u045e9e83" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775804402454-6215da64-a75b-41f5-b2f3-1b393b72654f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8fb36444-c1d2-424d-a569-22ecc63738b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u43b80d2f-f2a7-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A830%2C%22height%22%3A277%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A90907%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1432%2C%22originHeight%22%3A478%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LETPUL(RLAS)-N(RPULAI)%2COF(AS)I)BEAGAUSSIANPROBABITYPATH%2CANDHRISCORRESPONDINGFLON%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A1324%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAPDEFINEDASHLAI)%3DO(A)A%2BU(A).THEN.THEUNIQUEVECTORFELDTHATDEFINESHRHASTHEFORM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A212%2C%22width%22%3A1283%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSEQUENTLRUWM)GENERATESTHEGAUSSIANDATHD(MA).%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A433%2C%22width%22%3A789%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEOREM3(GAUSSIANCONDITIONALVECTORFIELD%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A731%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80(R-4())%E5%8D%814(%22%2C%22x%22%3A648%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A330%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2201(31)%22%2C%22x%22%3A609%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UI(R01)-%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A318%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220I(31)%22%2C%22x%22%3A610%2C%22y%22%3A297%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.003%2C0.0091%2C0.999%2C0.9909%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c6d4c7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uba013160%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="svxoJ" id="svxoJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uaa888fb1" id="uaa888fb1">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="uf80eb49d" id="uf80eb49d"> 𝑺𝑷𝑬𝑪𝑰𝑨𝑳 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑵𝑪𝑬𝑺 𝑶𝑭 𝑮𝑨𝑼𝑺𝑺𝑰𝑨𝑵 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑫𝑰𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵𝑨𝑳 𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑩𝑨𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑰𝑻𝒀 𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑯𝑺</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uee67cd51" id="uee67cd51"><strong><span data-lake-id="u99c2d824" id="u99c2d824" style="color: #70000D">扩散条件向量场（Diffusion Conditional VFs）：扩散模型从数据点出发，逐步向其中加入噪声，直至其近似为纯噪声。这一过程可以表述为随机过程；而为在任意时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22djdiQ%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uabd0c605" id="uabd0c605" style="color: #70000D">获得闭式表达，随机过程必须满足较为严格的条件。高斯形式的条件概率路径</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c1cc58d8983c0bf751a86036ffca9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wOnM9%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13f59867" id="u13f59867" style="color: #70000D">的均值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcba5491bfa79cd31e373a9ad86808204.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aMty5%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8152a49e" id="u8152a49e" style="color: #70000D">与标准差</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb6a255eae35327783cfcbff2981ece8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jnXjg%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u56c4325a" id="u56c4325a" style="color: #70000D">具有特定选取方式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u696254f8" id="u696254f8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uecc79f6a" id="uecc79f6a">方差爆炸型（Variance Exploding, VE）路径：其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47db06c23eda0f320721582da4e8a231.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YCron%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1aa65d43" id="u1aa65d43">是一个递增函数，满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_0%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f7e2955cf9127f6a0405f6ffceed165.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nl0zd%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f47fa36" id="u6f47fa36">且</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_1%5C%5Cgg%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1590731cc2471d37f5ca1d8af43cbfb1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gbeEE%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8db6fb6d" id="u8db6fb6d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B1-t%7D%5E2%20I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe717cbe38b58b542e3b122c23c7ef9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pUcar%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6961b3f" id="ue6961b3f">。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1)%3Dx_1%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B1-t%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffd7b21516a7a572dd985d5da3f481924.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WACwS%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc0799a78" id="uc0799a78" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma'_%7B1-t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B1-t%7D%7D(x-x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe25b0cea88175f0dfa86133e4bc18dab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iBgft%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u47f40bf1" id="u47f40bf1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufcd0aff6" id="ufcd0aff6">方差保持型（Variance Preserving, VP）扩散路径具有如下形式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6ad299eb" id="u6ad299eb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Calpha_%7B1-t%7D%20x_1%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7B1-t%7D%5E2)%20I)%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20where%20%7D%20%5C%5Calpha_t%20%3D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20T(t)%7D%2C%20T(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)ds%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b6b3cb4d564120aa5b0edb918a2ca79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wyWbM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u331ce7cf" id="u331ce7cf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha'_%7B1-t%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7B1-t%7D%5E2%7D%20(%5C%5Calpha_%7B1-t%7D%20x%20-%20x_1)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7BT'(1-t)%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Be%5E%7B-T(1-t)%7D%20x%20-%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20T(1-t)%7D%20x_1%7D%7B1%20-%20e%5E%7B-T(1-t)%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84ac3fc3940d84a1805ef1d69f376b62.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IF7ie%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucd106903" id="ucd106903"><span data-lake-id="u915df327" id="u915df327">对于这些条件扩散过程而言，所构造的条件向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22fcbb3c2f70f72f94b9ab2a5e06f9e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wZnf6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46dd9fa7" id="u46dd9fa7">与先前在确定性概率流中使用的向量场是一致的。尽管如此，将这种扩散条件向量场与 Flow Matching 目标结合，仍提供一种极具吸引力的训练替代方案</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub651e8cb" id="ub651e8cb"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucda38e8d" id="ucda38e8d" style="color: #70000D">最优传输条件向量场（Optimal Transport Conditional VFs）：令其均值与标准差均随时间作线性变化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc1ba0fcb" id="uc1ba0fcb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_t(x)%20%3D%20tx_1%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20%5C%5Csigma_t(x)%20%3D%201%20-%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)t.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6991e08a0386b0eccf15238053df4498.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kwefa%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u107498b8" id="u107498b8"><span data-lake-id="u6ea67f01" id="u6ea67f01">可知该路径由如下向量场生成：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub5499c38" id="ub5499c38" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_1%20-%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)x%7D%7B1%20-%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F547e93f463651e15541e8c49cf36425c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eCfxl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uaca6932a" id="uaca6932a"><span data-lake-id="ud86137e9" id="ud86137e9">与扩散条件向量场不同的是，该向量场在整个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85d2cfca61ca1cdb1fcd47ce76c4dc4b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G9X5J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc9782ea" id="ucc9782ea">区间上均有定义。与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22fcbb3c2f70f72f94b9ab2a5e06f9e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HlWqE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4812927f" id="u4812927f">对应的条件流为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub4c5dab0" id="ub4c5dab0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%20%3D%20(1%20-%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)t)x%20%2B%20tx_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c586df5423d1c1520cc58a14882035c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zxg34%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4ca188c8" id="u4ca188c8"><span data-lake-id="u87dce98b" id="u87dce98b">在这种情形下，CFM 损失可写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u181786cd" id="u181786cd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BCFM%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%20q(x_1)%2C%20p(x_0)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20v_t(%5C%5Cpsi_t(x_0))%20-%20(x_1%20-%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)x_0)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F110c3db2a2015c3e13d039bcbb788b82.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WygrZ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub91655e1" id="ub91655e1"><span data-lake-id="u8354ae31" id="u8354ae31">令均值与标准差作线性变化，不仅能够得到简洁且直观的概率路径，而且这种构造在下述意义下还是最优的。条件流</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe814ac84bc525fb5d50caaf1acff519b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BUuDm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e4675af" id="u0e4675af">实际上是两个高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c311ea37c7cb85f5df5be6502ab7e8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HaExb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63f1c8bc" id="u63f1c8bc">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29024929e4df2ebdc13fc9d05050e73.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N5HYI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e9e6cb6" id="u3e9e6cb6">之间的最优传输位移映射。从直观上看，在 OT 位移映射下，粒子始终沿直线轨迹、以恒定速度运动。展示扩散条件向量场与 OT 条件向量场下的采样轨迹。从扩散路径进行采样时，轨迹可能会越过最终样本，从而产生不必要的回溯；相比之下，OT 路径则保证始终保持直线形态</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6346ce0e" id="u6346ce0e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1775806314961-09e87909-3a58-4864-ab38-2f6fd5631905.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub494b5fe-a472-4228-9337-f66d6d139fd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u76ef775b-2a58-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A436%2C%22height%22%3A227%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A81619%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A627%2C%22originHeight%22%3A327%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIFFUSION%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OT%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.0351%2C0.0463%2C0.9912%2C0.9748%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2356b157%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua43c7f80%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="DUqL1" id="DUqL1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3af93d90" id="u3af93d90">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="u97264fe6" id="u97264fe6"> 𝐓𝐡𝐞𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐦 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐨𝐟𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u98ce9143" id="u98ce9143"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bbd1a70" id="u2bbd1a70" style="color: #101E60">𝓣𝓱𝓮𝓸𝓻𝓮𝓶 𝟏 ：由条件向量场加权聚合得到的边缘向量场，能够生成由条件概率路径边缘化所得的边缘概率路径</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua48650eb" id="ua48650eb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%20p_t(x)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%20p_t(x%7Cx_1)%20%5C%5Cright)%20q(x_1)%20dx_1%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiv%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)%20p_t(x%7Cx_1)%20%5C%5Cright)%20q(x_1)%20dx_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiv%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cint%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)%20p_t(x%7Cx_1)%20q(x_1)%20dx_1%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiv%7D(u_t(x)%20p_t(x))%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02ff1893a94b0273402b7f76d0c8daf0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AOU53%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9c801441" id="u9c801441"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2ac023f2" id="u2ac023f2" style="color: #5C0036">𝓣𝓱𝓮𝓸𝓻𝓮𝓶 𝟐 ：假设对于任意</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa66577d036fb0caeb63d76151908e5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qaAci%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u55c5b05e" id="u55c5b05e" style="color: #5C0036">以及</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85d2cfca61ca1cdb1fcd47ce76c4dc4b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dAIwa%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u784aa6bb" id="u784aa6bb" style="color: #5C0036">，均有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87fd8dfc834bd16e9fd70bc707a20fa1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GzwfM%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u74349cbe" id="u74349cbe" style="color: #5C0036">。则在忽略与参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EUaji%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f464758" id="u2f464758" style="color: #5C0036">无关的常数项后，条件 Flow Matching 损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCFM%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb7361b442a33a7d6c29a9e350b37a283.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xy3BJ%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u305a87e1" id="u305a87e1" style="color: #5C0036">与 Flow Matching 损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BFM%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc847c0eeeb7e7809dced9f5918b11fe9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X03M8%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc49f3e90" id="uc49f3e90" style="color: #5C0036">相等。因此，有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BFM%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCFM%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef4c2435bb1080619d388355c0642dff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dqLBc%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card></p><ul list="u06a8f1c1"><li fid="u924912a1" data-lake-id="ub9541ba5" id="ub9541ba5"><span data-lake-id="u271360fb" id="u271360fb">为保证下述各积分均存在，并使后续能够依据 Fubini 定理交换积分次序，假设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Cx%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75176acee5fa5d762a836d7e6cc62e26.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z8i7i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7a74926" id="ua7a74926">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa28d90a765883cf834a7e983e31d2b6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22whzyO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d9ade3c" id="u5d9ade3c">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c1cc58d8983c0bf751a86036ffca9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VstHT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u954b859d" id="u954b859d">均以足够快的速度衰减至零；同时</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oSEYQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35887eb3" id="u35887eb3">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DCYwl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ca0b5b4" id="u5ca0b5b4">以及</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe3493fd5450bc9cc99da5d9acb57828.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ohMlh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0aa468e1" id="u0aa468e1">都是有界的。首先，由二维范数的标准双线性展开可得：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1e6a8457" id="u1e6a8457" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%20-%20u_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%26%3D%20%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20-%202%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20u_t(x)%5C%5Crangle%20%2B%20%5C%5C%7Cu_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%20-%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%26%3D%20%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20-%202%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)%5C%5Crangle%20%2B%20%5C%5C%7Cu_t(x%7Cx_1)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e9a00b87b41e89b1bd0bfe2f6a393e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BJ8VS%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub5ceeec1"><li fid="u06e68b4c" data-lake-id="u25e5c95d" id="u25e5c95d"><span data-lake-id="u442b3c89" id="u442b3c89">接下来，注意到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XnsGa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5782b5de" id="u5782b5de">与参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AJPg4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc9f995a" id="ucc9f995a">无关，并且有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u04676abb" id="u04676abb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_t(x)%7D%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20p_t(x)dx%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20p_t(x%7Cx_1)q(x_1)dx_1%20dx%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq(x_1)%2Cp_t(x%7Cx_1)%7D%5C%5C%7Cv_t(x)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3f6dd3d96cd852ee72da02da1df2560.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tEg6R%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u031bcc20"><li fid="u8dd35843" data-lake-id="uea5e0de0" id="uea5e0de0"><span data-lake-id="u97baa456" id="u97baa456">进一步地</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubf0f3f6a" id="ubf0f3f6a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_t(x)%7D%20%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20u_t(x)%20%5C%5Crangle%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cint%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)p_t(x%7Cx_1)q(x_1)dx_1%7D%7Bp_t(x)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crangle%20p_t(x)dx%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20%5C%5Cint%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)p_t(x%7Cx_1)q(x_1)dx_1%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crangle%20dx%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)%20%5C%5Crangle%20p_t(x%7Cx_1)q(x_1)dx_1%20dx%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq(x_1)%2Cp_t(x%7Cx_1)%7D%20%5C%5Clangle%20v_t(x)%2C%20u_t(x%7Cx_1)%20%5C%5Crangle%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38dbb30369bd9f5491cd9cb7cd3ff829.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xz20E%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u43418f97" id="u43418f97"><strong><span data-lake-id="uda0a2b16" id="uda0a2b16" style="color: #DF2A3F">𝓣𝓱𝓮𝓸𝓻𝓮𝓶 𝟑：为给定的高斯条件概率路径显式构造出唯一的条件速度场，从而把条件 flow matching 的监督目标具体化</span></strong></p><ul list="u6f4c1188"><li fid="u2f7371e3" data-lake-id="u74aec161" id="u74aec161"><span data-lake-id="u62fa549e" id="u62fa549e">为简化记号，记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t(x)%3Du_t(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffdeb8a8e92d6e5c8a20b612cef0fef32.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hMXNw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9d097b4" id="ua9d097b4">现考虑：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u72a731ed" id="u72a731ed" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%3Dw_t(%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c6ae2725072483b7fae0f0ef102d6ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P8xQ3%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua98699e1"><li fid="u97276b1c" data-lake-id="u3ef71d9b" id="u3ef71d9b"><span data-lake-id="u949a2f5b" id="u949a2f5b">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8101877e2e4931888f0c6805b345e501.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NgHUx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e34a68f" id="u5e34a68f">是可逆的（因为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6936d86979e350cd7ca372ae4cc75fc4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JOwJb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc462cc52" id="uc462cc52">），令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%3D%5C%5Cpsi_t%5E%7B-1%7D(y)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e30b9ecb8b3790af480d9943691be32.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ngKEZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68498a46" id="u68498a46">则有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua74584db" id="ua74584db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t'(%5C%5Cpsi_t%5E%7B-1%7D(y))%3Dw_t(y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1ce080a804f1bc0d0fb0e9d35414834.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HuJ1C%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u795cba11"><li fid="u5763c96b" data-lake-id="u95989133" id="u95989133"><span data-lake-id="u3600e0bd" id="u3600e0bd">另一方面，由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe814ac84bc525fb5d50caaf1acff519b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YshvC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf36134dc" id="uf36134dc">的表达式可得其逆映射为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubed612c1" id="ubed612c1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t%5E%7B-1%7D(y)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7By%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02df395ccc1088a4d40a9c3963f60ea3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MLrR2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u628f424c" id="u628f424c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t'(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma_t'(x_1)x%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmu_t'(x_1).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5798eb55988d1749d560f2eabd146a0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ajV3Q%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue7ac3382"><li fid="u484629d9" data-lake-id="ubbdb8716" id="ubbdb8716"><span data-lake-id="uc1dd3659" id="uc1dd3659">将上述两个式子代入，即可得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua6984d10" id="ua6984d10" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t(y)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_t'(x_1)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_t(x_1)%7D(y%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_t(x_1))%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmu_t'(x_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7a9a05243086b8a14ef575827ad4c76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pg3aW%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="x3Fmj" id="x3Fmj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4ed632e9" id="u4ed632e9">🎨</span><span data-lake-id="u548a8736" id="u548a8736"> 𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄 𝐃𝐈𝐅𝐅𝐔𝐒𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝟑 (𝐒𝐃𝟑)  </span></h1><p data-lake-id="uebf0fdc8" id="uebf0fdc8"><span data-lake-id="ueebee0ac" id="ueebee0ac">Rectified Flow 是近年来提出的一类生成模型框架，其核心思想是在数据分布与噪声分布之间构造近似直线的传输路径。相比传统扩散模型中较为复杂的弯曲轨迹，Rectified Flow 在理论性质和概念形式上更为简洁。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u612b8063" id="u612b8063" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，尽管其具有潜在优势，该方法尚未在实际应用中被确立为主流或标准范式</span></strong></p><ul list="u4d9743bf"><li fid="u9226e529" data-lake-id="u74f2d15b" id="u74f2d15b"><span data-lake-id="u82147dfe" id="u82147dfe">针对 Rectified Flow 模型训练中的噪声尺度采样策略进行改进，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1908de1f" id="u1908de1f" style="color: #663000">通过将采样分布偏向更具感知相关性的噪声尺度，提升模型对关键生成阶段的学习能力</span></strong></li><li fid="u9226e529" data-lake-id="u11f747d7" id="u11f747d7"><span data-lake-id="u02d75c05" id="u02d75c05">提出一种新的基于 Transformer 的文本到图像生成架构。不同于传统方法中将固定文本表示作为条件输入的设计，该架构</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udeb523a0" id="udeb523a0" style="color: #00346B">分别为图像模态和文本模态设置独立的参数化表示通路，并允许图像 token 与文本 token 在网络内部进行双向信息交互</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubf4f5c61" id="ubf4f5c61">，从而增强模型的文本理解能力、文字生成与排版能力，并提升人类偏好评价结果</span></li><li fid="u9226e529" data-lake-id="u5667fe79" id="u5667fe79"><strong><span data-lake-id="u041ac348" id="u041ac348" style="color: #00346B">论文证明该架构具有可预测的缩放规律，即随着模型规模和训练配置的变化，验证损失呈现出稳定的下降趋势</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uee7d4c26" id="uee7d4c26">。实验结果表明，验证损失越低，模型在多种自动评估指标和人类评估中的文本到图像生成质量通常越高</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u479ef837" id="u479ef837"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0cd1c266" id="u0cd1c266">关键问题：应当选择怎样的前向路径</span></strong></p><ul list="u1b86172f"><li fid="u0a8b40fd" data-lake-id="ud782521a" id="ud782521a"><span data-lake-id="u9add4258" id="u9add4258">前向路径的选择会对采样过程产生重要影响。例如，如果某一前向过程未能充分去除数据中的噪声，则可能导致训练分布与测试分布之间出现不一致，进而在生成结果中产生诸如灰色图像样本等伪影</span></li><li fid="u0a8b40fd" data-lake-id="u67d377b9" id="u67d377b9"><span data-lake-id="u0ed35222" id="u0ed35222">前向过程的设计还会影响模型所学习到的反向过程，从而进一步影响采样效率。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5fe5fd5" id="uc5fe5fd5" style="color: #2A4200">相较于弯曲路径，直线路径在理想情况下可以通过单步积分进行模拟，并且不易受到误差累积的影响。由于采样过程中的每一步通常都对应一次神经网络前向计算，因此路径形式的选择会直接影响模型的采样速度</span></strong></li><li fid="u0a8b40fd" data-lake-id="u6f7a25bf" id="u6f7a25bf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fe3f038" id="u6fe3f038" style="color: #5C0036">Rectified Flow 是一种特殊的前向路径设计方式，其核心思想是在数据与噪声之间建立直线连接。尽管这类模型在理论性质上具有优势，但其尚未在实践中被明确确立为主流方法</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u62b0ef68" id="u62b0ef68"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f647a0f" id="u1f647a0f">核心贡献主要包括以下三个方面</span></strong></p><ul list="u011b0434"><li fid="u736daea2" data-lake-id="u6c0489e3" id="u6c0489e3"><span data-lake-id="uc2db54c0" id="uc2db54c0">围绕不同扩散模型与 Rectified Flow 表述开展大规模、系统性的实验研究，以确定更优的模型设置。提出新的 Rectified Flow 噪声采样器，相较已有采样方法能够进一步提升模型性能</span></li><li fid="u736daea2" data-lake-id="u4dfcee01" id="u4dfcee01"><span data-lake-id="u68ae6422" id="u68ae6422">设计一种新的、可扩展的文本到图像生成架构，该架构支持文本 token 流与图像 token 流在网络内部进行双向融合。实验表明，该架构相较于 UViT 和 DiT 等已有骨干网络具有明显优势</span></li><li fid="u736daea2" data-lake-id="uf0887bf1" id="uf0887bf1"><span data-lake-id="u8c116c8c" id="u8c116c8c">对模型进行缩放规律研究，证明其遵循可预测的缩放趋势。进一步表明，验证损失的降低与文本到图像生成性能的提升密切相关，这一趋势在 T2I-CompBench、GenEval 等自动评估指标以及人类评分中均得到验证</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="EcQb8" id="EcQb8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uec882e8f" id="uec882e8f">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u5cebd203" id="u5cebd203"> 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐮𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐨𝐟 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u36ae3bf9" id="u36ae3bf9"><span data-lake-id="u2346db90" id="u2346db90">考虑一类生成模型，其目标是在噪声分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0cbb5c7cd342b93806e29c7f7bde39a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uL5J6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e7e94be" id="u5e7e94be">中的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f876131d98d9551f6ca6963237dc50f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oqCK9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6554f74d" id="u6554f74d">与数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8aac8881bce7e34b4263a6f2935f0ec5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l8BsO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2289f131" id="u2289f131">中的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18b6117da832bd74fdb2b88d8f4ad17b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XH50G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd61b76f" id="ubd61b76f">之间建立映射关系。该映射可以通过如下常微分方程（ordinary differential equation, ODE）来刻画：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8e2088d1" id="u8e2088d1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dy_t%20%3D%20v_%5C%5CTheta(y_t%2C%20t)%20dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d56c38b5414dcf5bbb80c50294238ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qU1yw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u113d6413" id="u113d6413"><span data-lake-id="u5fec85a3" id="u5fec85a3">其中速度场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%7B%5C%5CTheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c1f2f91d746e123ecda53b84f4db837.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UgxOp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf167d97f" id="uf167d97f">由神经网络参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CTheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa9af6282893feb38ba4e70db0a84dddb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NQRzS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12788ef9" id="u12788ef9">进行参数化。Chen 早期工作提出，可以通过可微 ODE 求解器直接求解上述方程。然而，这一过程通常具有较高的计算成本，尤其是在使用大规模神经网络结构来参数化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%7B%5C%5CTheta%7D(y_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6ff357e2a08d1fdfccc80a7eb3006bff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kgP9m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc4d26c1" id="ubc4d26c1">时，计算开销会进一步增加。一种更高效的替代方案是：不直接通过数值求解 ODE 来模拟生成过程，而是直接回归一个向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57a1a0ee99c608b4e02778330b6ef49d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TY2lC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44dc32ad" id="u44dc32ad">，使其能够在数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8aac8881bce7e34b4263a6f2935f0ec5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WGwr0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue64eef94" id="ue64eef94">与噪声分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0cbb5c7cd342b93806e29c7f7bde39a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eVf6N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71386dde" id="u71386dde">之间生成一条概率路径。为构造这样的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UKFQb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u248890bb" id="u248890bb">，首先定义一个前向过程，用以描述连接</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8aac8881bce7e34b4263a6f2935f0ec5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rd18v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52baf53d" id="u52baf53d">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86a659e6dbee5a8c8df9719a26211e7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SSHvk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u907aadf1" id="u907aadf1">的概率路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9243e6f4adcf63fbacc62a3f80962006.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fiour%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf36259cf" id="uf36259cf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%20%3D%20a_t%20x_0%20%2B%20b_t%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%20%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I)%20.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e2afc17be060945f7e17327df3cc7a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZhtZ9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u539fcd26" id="u539fcd26"><span data-lake-id="u85f28b12" id="u85f28b12">当满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_0%20%3D%201%2Cb_0%20%3D%200%2Ca_1%20%3D%200%2Cb_1%20%3D%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4923409f1f4fd92ef33a6a47eb03a3e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aSeuj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u395ca037" id="u395ca037">时，该过程在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ems7T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1794cacf" id="u1794cacf">时对应数据分布，在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PhI4O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf2a5810f" id="uf2a5810f">时对应噪声分布。其边缘分布可写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u948130b6" id="u948130b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(z_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%20p_t(z_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F118cffcae4c105609188b157d3ce93b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IvL1v%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u112bd10b" id="u112bd10b"><span data-lake-id="ub680c2bd" id="ub680c2bd">因此与数据分布和噪声分布保持一致。为刻画</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb950546bfda135690bb185f35b23b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Saw4c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a474fcd" id="u1a474fcd">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cxIIi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4404e3c" id="uc4404e3c">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XWkh2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8637516f" id="u8637516f">之间的关系，引入映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpsi_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6380da3942583d8aa2b1a741e2b5a204.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EbHAI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7923899" id="uf7923899">及其对应的条件向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57a1a0ee99c608b4e02778330b6ef49d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oh2EQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud9af6272" id="ud9af6272" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t(%5C%5Ccdot%20%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%3A%20x_0%20%5C%5Cmapsto%20a_t%20x_0%20%2B%20b_t%20%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd43eb681610bd7cb2f37a16a399f7c87.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rAKjz%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u37bccbc1" id="u37bccbc1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(z%20%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cpsi'_t(%5C%5Cpsi_t%5E%7B-1%7D(z%20%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F210fb3115e140dee9301a28b8722ca57.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TljJQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u63708e6e" id="u63708e6e"><span data-lake-id="u1a11dfde" id="u1a11dfde">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Facee7336bde30fd835934b89e3ba9e20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ilRMn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20b0bfca" id="u20b0bfca">可以看作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t'%20%3D%20u_t(z_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82701cc6329b9d2a2f703ecd157dcb8a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yGXcJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7166a5a0" id="u7166a5a0">的解，并且其初始值为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%3Dx_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ce8cef8bc61369cf930d8d7808f33fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PXLaF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04b9777e" id="u04b9777e">，因此条件向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd77f31b805e38484b8904d30fc0c291.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rn18I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ea0e609" id="u8ea0e609">能够生成条件概率路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17280c59d96d93fdcec9bca86c13293f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DZgJX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96bbf996" id="u96bbf996">。值得注意的是，基于这些条件向量场，可以进一步构造出一个边缘向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57a1a0ee99c608b4e02778330b6ef49d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uEVqZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u885a3a17" id="u885a3a17">，使其生成边缘概率路径</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc94096f0c327b693e084140d512d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m3fPW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u980f7756" id="u980f7756">。具体形式为</span></p><p data-lake-id="udc3f3043" id="udc3f3043" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(z)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%20u_t(z%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_t(z%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%7Bp_t(z)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8d4e3de15c8d4e78617c3122c0437e7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JRM8t%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc5b8ae58" id="uc5b8ae58"><span data-lake-id="u9f6a755e" id="u9f6a755e">如果直接使用 Flow Matching 目标来回归边缘向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51b3390153fd75978bd368d2e9a502cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SlX5I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b766228" id="u4b766228">，则目标函数为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua2653b92" id="ua2653b92" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BFM%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%20p_t(z)%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20v_%5C%5CTheta(z%2C%20t)%20-%20u_t(z)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde619d401563840449e3839734a8ed53.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aqQpf%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0cf69281" id="u0cf69281"><span data-lake-id="udbdb5494" id="udbdb5494">然而，由于上述边缘向量场涉及对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b08a9538d3d0ce678f97c16cbc0c902.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EG3Td%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e3b9f7f" id="u8e3b9f7f">的边缘化计算，直接优化该目标在实践中是不可行的。相比之下，Conditional Flow Matching 使用条件向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(z%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6605d51ee094ab36a2dd4511e9488317.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IYo71%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c63bedc" id="u9c63bedc">构造如下目标：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud50fc55d" id="ud50fc55d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BCFM%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%20p_t(z%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%2C%20p(%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20v_%5C%5CTheta(z%2C%20t)%20-%20u_t(z%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0829528843640c13383f71514134ffc7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OQu6i%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u17bdda30" id="u17bdda30"><span data-lake-id="uc6dcdaf0" id="uc6dcdaf0">为将上述损失函数转化为显式形式，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t'(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%3D%20a_t'%20x_0%20%2B%20b_t'%20%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c5485bad1336ce8e80411ac9aa33282.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wjb3V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf2483b5" id="udf2483b5">以及</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpsi_t%5E%7B-1%7D(z%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bz-b_t%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7Ba_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5565fa89491c0e6b39776083baa291a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NOyUd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d462af0" id="u5d462af0">代入条件向量场的定义中，可得</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc71e9910" id="uc71e9910" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t'%20%3D%20u_t(z_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba_t'%7D%7Ba_t%7Dz_t%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20b_t%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba_t'%7D%7Ba_t%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bb_t'%7D%7Bb_t%7D%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d16ced5138309b207bb065304d44cdb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mVfWM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub457fa9b" id="ub457fa9b"><span data-lake-id="u27306cdb" id="u27306cdb">进一步地，定义信噪比的对数形式为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba_t%5E2%7D%7Bb_t%5E2%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e75215a50129353a4d1f7fe6501a04c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lM1gh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f60ecae" id="u3f60ecae">则有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t'%20%3D%202%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba_t'%7D%7Ba_t%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bb_t'%7D%7Bb_t%7D%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff87bbfc93e2f497ab63086fd5b77506f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AxWEx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2495ec1d" id="u2495ec1d">因此，上式可以重写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua17705fe" id="ua17705fe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u_t(z_t%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba'_t%7D%7Ba_t%7Dz_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bb_t%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clambda'_t%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b6706016cf15b3c1652442ce3882324.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RyJIE%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uef67f1a7" id="uef67f1a7"><span data-lake-id="u0e2ffe7b" id="u0e2ffe7b">随后，可以利用该形式将 Conditional Flow Matching 目标重新参数化为一个噪声预测目标：  </span></p><p data-lake-id="u4e07625d" id="u4e07625d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BCFM%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cp_t(z%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%2Cp(%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%5C%5C%7Cv_%5C%5CTheta(z%2C%20t)%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba'_t%7D%7Ba_t%7Dz%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bb_t%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clambda'_t%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5Cn%5Cn%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cp_t(z%7C%5C%5Cepsilon)%2Cp(%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%5C%5Cleft(-%5C%5Cfrac%7Bb_t%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clambda'_t%5C%5Cright)%5E2%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5CTheta(z%2C%20t)%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faea50adf33496aa221d4649f67b64e81.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EwMlV%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubc1ecaf6" id="ubc1ecaf6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20~%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5CTheta%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B-2%7D%7B%5C%5Clambda'_t%20b_t%7D(v_%5C%5CTheta%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Ba'_t%7D%7Ba_t%7Dz).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d6d7171375e18b1eb7b1ffde09959e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gKKd5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucdbe7451" id="ucdbe7451"><span data-lake-id="u2c658699" id="u2c658699">在上述目标函数中引入与时间相关的权重，并不会改变其最优解。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2979d639" id="u2979d639" style="color: #DF2A3F">因此，可以推导出多种加权损失函数形式。这些加权形式虽然都能够为模型提供朝向期望解的训练信号，但可能会影响优化过程中的训练轨迹</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u255fca34" id="u255fca34">。为在统一框架下分析不同方法，包括经典扩散模型表述，可以参照将目标函数写为如下形式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u32e2799f" id="u32e2799f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_w(x_0)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D(t)%2C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20w_t%20%5C%5Clambda'_t%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5CTheta(z_t%2C%20t)%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B8pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%20%7D%20w_t%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clambda'_t%20b_t%5E2%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20corresponds%20to%20%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BCFM%7D%20.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5598b3b060817fc97246c815d4b734a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IhGrZ%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="ZQjJb" id="ZQjJb" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1362a4a0" id="u1362a4a0">🛤️</span><span data-lake-id="ua20fe3b8" id="ua20fe3b8"> 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐣𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ued88a4af" id="ued88a4af"><strong><span data-lake-id="u83e7265b" id="u83e7265b">Rectified Flow 将前向过程定义为数据分布与标准正态分布之间的直线路径</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf70a1f79" id="uf70a1f79" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%20%3D%20(1-t)x_0%20%2B%20t%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a3822bbcaa30c89ab1fdaf68abd0840.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T5NFQ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u332cfee8"><li fid="u587eac81" data-lake-id="ud71bfe12" id="ud71bfe12"><span data-lake-id="u9081900c" id="u9081900c">模型优化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCFM%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3541c3231dafc3ba8c0954116313d049.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NhxNv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6207d164" id="u6207d164">，其对应的权重形式为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BRF%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7B1-t%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd25ae53899a95f3616ff4c8fa98a2979.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oUpyC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20afc510" id="u20afc510">此时，神经网络的输出直接用于参数化速度场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5CTheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa5b6cf102969f980a386dc08fca71852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aOxAy%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d08817f" id="u6d08817f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8afc72b" id="ue8afc72b">EDM 采用如下形式的前向过程</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9aeae72a" id="u9aeae72a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%20%3D%20x_0%20%2B%20b_t%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%20%7D%20b_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp%20F_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%7D%5E%7B-1%7D(t%7CP_m%2C%20P_s%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58c737528d01543310892fd2aee609ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eyYKB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud3086e03"><li fid="ud8a589b6" data-lake-id="u5680d4cc" id="u5680d4cc"><span data-lake-id="u589307c7" id="u589307c7">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1a8d1effed6a015548a3435e4e8383e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y1Bjb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8a49734" id="ua8a49734">表示均值为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99a09b9d4cb98a4b1aeaf88e914dbbd1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PCIr8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd2cf5d8" id="udd2cf5d8">、方差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20P_s%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F678d9ed65064c6a5ea9379155c7552ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p5yAe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38c98b69" id="u38c98b69">的正态分布的分位数函数</span></li><li fid="ud8a589b6" data-lake-id="u2c3b4136" id="u2c3b4136"><span data-lake-id="u3da5500d" id="u3da5500d">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%20%5C%5Csim%20U(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e2ba6c0fb5623638419f1176b756698.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I54Hq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubeb965f2" id="ubeb965f2">时，对数信噪比满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(-2P_m%2C%20(2P_s)%5E2).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce7cbfa3c09abec82b64f85285381cb1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lAOoZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u069812db" id="u069812db">EDM 中的网络采用 F-prediction 参数化形式，其损失函数可以写成统一加权形式</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb24d25d4723525e67f7ac7ba2903a29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LDWrO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4652a12c" id="u4652a12c">，对应的权重为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BEDM%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Clambda_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20-2P_m%2C%20(2P_s)%5E2)%20%5C%5Cleft(%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda_t%7D%20%2B%200.5%5E2%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa48890ef0c0da745beba954a5d4b2f07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZNNwi%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u23ffe1f4" id="u23ffe1f4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d2ae0e9" id="u3d2ae0e9">Nichol 和 Dhariwal 提出如下形式的前向过程</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8c82c145" id="u8c82c145" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Ccos%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7Dt%5C%5Cright)x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csin%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7Dt%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cepsilon%20.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e04a3b72ca1a0f65a06601212f6977e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njW2O%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u612cd7a7"><li fid="u57617fd6" data-lake-id="u1a893b26" id="u1a893b26"><span data-lake-id="uc815f430" id="uc815f430">当该前向过程与 ϵ-parameterization 以及对应的噪声预测损失结合时，其对应的权重为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Clambda_t%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ab733438c480c11aa04bb4e41112a93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iNezM%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u57617fd6" data-lake-id="u9da89e8c" id="u9da89e8c"><span data-lake-id="u3bc952a5" id="u3bc952a5">当其与 v-prediction 损失结合时，对应的权重则为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t%20%3D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda_t%2F2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c91ecfe9465151a5236e12df28560c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JmpYn%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0fb09504" id="u0fb09504"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua02e3c10" id="ua02e3c10">LDM 采用对 DDPM 噪声调度策略的修改版本。二者都属于方差保持型调度，即满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-a_t%5E2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc356be10174306aceda053cab32527d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OdiBE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue2622b33"><li fid="u07fd331e" data-lake-id="u8ac1bfb1" id="u8ac1bfb1"><span data-lake-id="u62784a02" id="u62784a02">在离散时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CT-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc94dfe0524ee40d1db23ddba80960783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DydTs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4fd114e" id="ua4fd114e">上，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc61a8b387e1cb6c40608f4ae65d6f6a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bF2Nv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue92e973b" id="ue92e973b">由扩散系数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5461c39cccf1b607eb60af7bed2ef8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f0wp7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94cfd126" id="u94cfd126">定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bs%3D0%7D%5E%7Bt%7D(1-%5C%5Cbeta_s)%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B1%2F2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07e0531828d8393dd7c7a10866834a12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gv7SI%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u07fd331e" data-lake-id="u00bb952b" id="u00bb952b"><span data-lake-id="ud74c09ab" id="ud74c09ab">给定边界值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdecb8d841cb22fe25cb19b7728af8574.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yln9J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u87bb9c6c" id="u87bb9c6c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_%7BT-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b69ae9f34c60adab81ce39d55367e13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IqbGn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u430a0d92" id="u430a0d92">时，DDPM 采用线性的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07e760daed81ee464529c50b3aece6f0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cCX1U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua58c4338" id="ua58c4338">调度：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7BT-1%7D%20(%5C%5Cbeta_%7BT-1%7D-%5C%5Cbeta_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad1b399c78e4294ba9fab687039a0011.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d0lWe%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u07fd331e" data-lake-id="ubb8a36e6" id="ubb8a36e6"><span data-lake-id="uebe4d1e4" id="uebe4d1e4">LDM 则采用对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F690acd7c2dc93dea7982ee7fabc7c734.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sFoid%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u172cffd3" id="u172cffd3">进行线性插值的调度方式：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_0%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7BT-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_%7BT-1%7D%7D-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_0%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5a33265a378587b5960b987e66c9f00.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nbH1w%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u07fd331e" data-lake-id="uc03fee35" id="uc03fee35"><span data-lake-id="u3926ada8" id="u3926ada8">DDPM 是直接在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EqFZL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c3ee8cb" id="u3c3ee8cb">上做线性插值，而 LDM 是先对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2ba016cc56e6f0e6996eb10d6e76d31.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BDNxi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d74eef9" id="u8d74eef9">做线性插值，再平方得到最终的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5461c39cccf1b607eb60af7bed2ef8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tcK9v%22%7D"></card></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="tM8rE" id="tM8rE" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub7f48f23" id="ub7f48f23">🦦</span><span data-lake-id="u65139f81" id="u65139f81"> 𝐓𝐚𝐢𝐥𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐝 𝐒𝐍𝐑 𝐒𝐚𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐑𝐅 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0de28db1" id="u0de28db1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9156fe90" id="u9156fe90" style="color: #70000D">RF 损失在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12d16d9672fe55e37279ae7043b605de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X5MZu%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u97d14de6" id="u97d14de6" style="color: #70000D">的所有时间步上均匀地训练速度场</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5CTheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa5b6cf102969f980a386dc08fca71852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nWNlo%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7c3f605" id="ua7c3f605" style="color: #70000D">。从直觉上看，所得的速度预测目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20-%20x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbdf430c12c78391ebe66486e64c535fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OZkYj%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua30672bb" id="ua30672bb" style="color: #70000D">在区间中部的时间步上更难学习。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7709770c" id="u7709770c" style="color: #000000">因为</span><span data-lake-id="uedb0fda7" id="uedb0fda7">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kt6N0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c3d732a" id="u5c3d732a">时，最优预测对应于噪声分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F091a44b6adf69464fa153ab4fb6b1d64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VbOWU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufeb768ab" id="ufeb768ab">的均值。而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zkyP6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueae8b11e" id="ueae8b11e">时，最优预测对应于数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mwi6f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1dd63ef5" id="u1dd63ef5"> 的均值。一般而言，将时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t263W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5f32cbe" id="uc5f32cbe">的采样分布从常用的均匀分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22U(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F644218c4292ce79d5096e51bf2e23f52.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aJ4Em%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf446b5ff" id="uf446b5ff">改为具有密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cpi(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F748a8850ded4ba01eba866aa2331c92e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IkmsM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8137b025" id="u8137b025">的分布，等价于引入一个加权损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7Bw%5E%5C%5Cpi%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d7a5c5f24d4daf9c32be0ca717f2ad1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ht37d%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u919759ff" id="u919759ff">，其中权重为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubcae80a2" id="ubcae80a2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_t%5E%5C%5Cpi%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7B1-t%7D%5C%5Cpi(t).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d8b17609a502d30b27bf10695c27cb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c0MmN%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc88a078b"><li fid="u63f190ce" data-lake-id="ua28960a4" id="ua28960a4"><span data-lake-id="u9c821d46" id="u9c821d46">通过更频繁地采样中间时间步，为这些时间步赋予更大的训练权重</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u603d32cc" id="u603d32cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7a2ef20" id="ub7a2ef20">Logit-Normal Sampling：一种能够对中间时间步赋予更高权重的分布是 logit-normal 分布。其密度函数为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2c3ba2f9" id="u2c3ba2f9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bln%7D%7D(t%3Bm%2Cs)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bs%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Cpi%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt(1-t)%7D%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D(t)-m)%5E2%7D%7B2s%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a2865aee55a6cef82e8410bc7d78f0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KcNlT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua7b7bd32" id="ua7b7bd32" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogit%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7B1-t%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ab389417117b3273a4a462fd9556ade.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m3O4A%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub228439f"><li fid="u42bd1a3a" data-lake-id="udc8ce427" id="udc8ce427"><span data-lake-id="u82e04c5a" id="u82e04c5a">该分布包含位置参数 m 和尺度参数 s。位置参数 m 能够将训练时间步偏向数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BaAHv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa2d683d" id="uaa2d683d"> 或噪声分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0cbb5c7cd342b93806e29c7f7bde39a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p8x2N%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u42bd1a3a" data-lake-id="u5d4a28c2" id="u5d4a28c2"><span data-lake-id="udcbd2e06" id="udcbd2e06">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%3C0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb572ca2d983148d98b7fd0b8cebb1ba7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xlzqF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34b8b415" id="u34b8b415">时，采样更偏向数据端</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nToRY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u571efaf1" id="u571efaf1">；当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a056cc725f44f75e5b55df173150e0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tqkRh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67c63501" id="u67c63501"> 时，采样更偏向噪声端</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F091a44b6adf69464fa153ab4fb6b1d64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UoRtc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud2e732e0" id="ud2e732e0">。尺度参数 s 控制分布的宽度</span></li><li fid="u42bd1a3a" data-lake-id="u6c6c99b1" id="u6c6c99b1"><span data-lake-id="u992c31fe" id="u992c31fe">从正态分布中采样随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(m%2Cs%5E2)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55d8e91f501001a79e03e723f2effd9e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EYNaI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cff9017" id="u1cff9017">然后通过标准 logistic 函数将其映射到区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12d16d9672fe55e37279ae7043b605de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P36cq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2579bf21" id="u2579bf21">，从而得到时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A31nk%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua283a4fc" id="ua283a4fc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1779891231617-010d60eb-4984-48c1-8003-4fe0db110a38.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubf2f6364-3ac8-4916-b717-e7c26d5618d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8c3b3c72-7b32-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A812.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A285%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A280378%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1489%2C%22originHeight%22%3A523%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%9D%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A301%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIN(T%3BM%3D0.0%2CS%3D0.5)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1239%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODE(T%3BS%3D-0.54%22%2C%22x%22%3A542%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A153%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TN(TM%3D0.0%2CS%3D1.0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1246%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIN(TM%3D-0.5%2CS%3D1.0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1244%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A202%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TN(T%3AM%3D0.5%2CS%3D1.0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1245%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A191%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TMODE(T%3AS%3D0.81)%22%2C%22x%22%3A542%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TTMODE(T%3AS%3D0.0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A543%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TTMODE(TS-1.29%22%2C%22x%22%3A539%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A785%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ecddd5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8779d8df%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2896befa" id="u2896befa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u470e9cef" id="u470e9cef">Mode Sampling with Heavy Tails：Logit-normal 密度在端点 0 和 1 处始终趋于零。为研究这一性质是否会对模型性能产生不利影响，采用一种在整个区间</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbe16b056b293b7e9345205999a56dc3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CKBSf%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaac82742" id="uaac82742">上都具有严格正密度的时间步采样分布。给定尺度参数 s，定义如下函数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub6331f8d" id="ub6331f8d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmode%7D%7D(u%3Bs)%20%3D%201-u%20-%20s%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ccos%5E2%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7Du%5C%5Cright)-1%2Bu%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc27d43ac729a00a19db27f6e0505810e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oMKw0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u17bc5bee"><li fid="u34e69755" data-lake-id="u28ec0e53" id="u28ec0e53"><span data-lake-id="u669e7f4b" id="u669e7f4b">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-1%20%5C%5Cleq%20s%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi-2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54800e41674a4598f0907940bd3ca94b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I41x3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8dc1dc0" id="uc8dc1dc0">时，该函数是单调的。可以利用该函数所诱导的分布进行采样，其对应的密度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmode%7D%7D(t%3Bs)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7Df_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmode%7D%7D%5E%7B-1%7D(t).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F35fe05fbbaec5ea1cfa32f7ec821464c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xtoHJ%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u34e69755" data-lake-id="uda66d1fc" id="uda66d1fc"><span data-lake-id="u357e83b3" id="u357e83b3">尺度参数 s 控制采样过程中对不同区域的偏好程度：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20s%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F917a4697a03b5c4d94f3c57624cf3756.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k7Yut%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7731474" id="uf7731474">时，采样更偏向区间中点；而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3C0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd7a6126c38becd652fbf0137fe52510.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dk7WO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f0d7acc" id="u1f0d7acc">时，采样更偏向两个端点。该形式也包含均匀采样作为一个特殊情形，即当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79d2037e638d92f055d5d4764bcb436e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f3DiJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4f42884" id="ua4f42884">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmode%7D%7D(t%3Bs%3D0)%3DU(t).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ba9db507ab4d41dd3c8e2d4bd4af4e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CPstJ%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u67271144" id="u67271144"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0593f87d" id="u0593f87d" style="color: #664900">CosMap 找到一个映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%3Au%20%5C%5Cmapsto%20f(u)%3Dt%2C%20u%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca793dacc74c33201fec23f5eab10828.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UaBec%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4ec6a5c" id="ud4ec6a5c" style="color: #664900">使得其对应的对数信噪比与 cosine schedule 的对数信噪比一致，即满足</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u73b0d1d6" id="u73b0d1d6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20%5C%5Ccos%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7Du%5C%5Cright)%20%7D%7B%20%5C%5Csin%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7Du%5C%5Cright)%20%7D%20%3D%202%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-f(u)%7D%7Bf(u)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82d8ca9de045f70f83f6b96a8fd2f580.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MKC1e%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1843dbd6"><li fid="u9b62b544" data-lake-id="u0973e665" id="u0973e665"><span data-lake-id="u82894b7d" id="u82894b7d">对该方程求解：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u%5C%5Csim%20U(u)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84de498189a87a8ddd01fc82ba893cf6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N19EH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1ddf649" id="ub1ddf649">时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3Df(u)%20%3D%201-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%20%5C%5Ctan%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7Du%5C%5Cright)%2B1%20%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd37767ebc677f5cb5a442364f6353b49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22avU3x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7dc598d4" id="u7dc598d4">由此可以得到对应的时间步密度：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufe309341" id="ufe309341" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCosMap%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7Df%5E%7B-1%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B%20%5C%5Cpi-2%5C%5Cpi%20t%2B2%5C%5Cpi%20t%5E2%20%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc04e2e68d5c3dbaa723492bfe433a2bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WotWl%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="YSf8c" id="YSf8c" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u328d7fa2" id="u328d7fa2">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u6d5d8833" id="u6d5d8833"> 𝐓𝐞𝐱𝐭-𝐭𝐨-𝐈𝐦𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u79a2da63" id="u79a2da63"><span data-lake-id="u00be6df7" id="u00be6df7">对于文本条件图像采样任务，模型需要同时建模文本与图像两种模态。整体设置遵循 LDM的做法，即在预训练自编码器的潜在空间中训练文本到图像生成模型。类似于将图像编码为潜在表示的过程，同时沿用已有方法，使用预训练且冻结的文本模型对文本条件 c 进行编码</span></p><p data-lake-id="u13e49ef2" id="u13e49ef2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1779892061545-9920dc8c-85f0-4a51-ab71-7e34bec805b5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u49487511-154b-4c79-9fb4-ef98eb3f3f4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u22bc5fa1-fccc-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A799.9091186523438%2C%22height%22%3A549%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A187096%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1395%2C%22originHeight%22%3A958%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)OVERVIEWOFALLCOMPONENTS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A919%2C%22width%22%3A352%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)ONEMM-DITBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A917%2C%22width%22%3A260%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MM-DIT-BLOCK1%22%2C%22x%22%3A379%2C%22y%22%3A498%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1048%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SINUSOIDALENCODING%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A516%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2277%E5%8D%8177TOKENS%22%2C%22x%22%3A233%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MM-DIT-BLOCK2%22%2C%22x%22%3A381%2C%22y%22%3A543%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MM-DIT-BLOCKD%22%2C%22x%22%3A380%2C%22y%22%3A645%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOISEDLATENT%22%2C%22x%22%3A555%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLIP-L14%22%2C%22x%22%3A246%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODULATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A471%2C%22y%22%3A733%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLIP-G%2F14%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A449%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSITIONAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A323%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNPATCHING%22%2C%22x%22%3A472%2C%22y%22%3A812%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TSXXL%22%2C%22x%22%3A411%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A922%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAPTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A258%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A873%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A1155%2C%22y%22%3A678%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIMESTEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A578%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224096%22%2C%22x%22%3A404%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A483%2C%22y%22%3A771%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A579%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PATCHING%22%2C%22x%22%3A567%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A259%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A861%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A1174%2C%22y%22%3A532%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A1247%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOD%3AAEE%22%2C%22x%22%3A918%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLP%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A1161%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A951%2C%22y%22%3A530%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A6%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIIU%22%2C%22x%22%3A865%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A919%2C%22y%22%3A298%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SILU%22%2C%22x%22%3A1249%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOD%3AOZ.E%2B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1138%2C%22y%22%3A711%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A928%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1168%2C%22y%22%3A298%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A937%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLP%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A476%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOD%3AA%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A1130%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A846%2C%22y%22%3A693%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A81%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b6ca9a%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3e685d29%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6f26e170" id="u6f26e170"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua4547749" id="ua4547749">多模态扩散骨干网络：模型架构建立在 DiT 之上。DiT 主要面向类别条件图像生成任务，并通过调制机制将扩散过程的时间步信息和类别标签信息注入网络。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u19f8bd9c" id="u19f8bd9c">类似地，将时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SytCD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1eb6c03" id="ua1eb6c03">的嵌入以及文本向量表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bvec%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F192bd0afc992cedca6494538126be321.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wHFjW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf30677d0" id="uf30677d0">作为调制机制的输入。然而，由于池化后的文本表示通常只保留文本输入中的粗粒度信息，网络还需要进一步利用文本的序列级表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bctxt%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09f20158c71efc9b091145e22e75850d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QBauH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0cc3ae66"><li fid="uecdb9e20" data-lake-id="u7333c7cc" id="u7333c7cc"><span data-lake-id="u67447c7e" id="u67447c7e">构造一个由文本输入嵌入和图像输入嵌入共同组成的序列。具体而言，对于潜在像素表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bh%20%5C%5Ctimes%20w%20%5C%5Ctimes%20c%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F125b3877d5571ce77bbf1d3cba85def9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oRfCF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue21adec2" id="ue21adec2">首先加入位置编码，并将其划分为 2×2 的 patch，然后展平为长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bh%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bw%7D%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1821cdcb4f267ef604aee6b807c162b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22txXvN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0de168bd" id="u0de168bd">的图像 patch 编码序列。随后将该图像 patch 编码序列与文本序列表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bctxt%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09f20158c71efc9b091145e22e75850d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t9JGf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7842a7ba" id="u7842a7ba">映射到相同的特征维度，并将二者在序列维度上进行拼接。遵循 DiT 的设计，依次应用一系列带调制机制的注意力层和 MLP 层</span></li><li fid="uecdb9e20" data-lake-id="u4909e93a" id="u4909e93a"><span data-lake-id="u063aa54b" id="u063aa54b">由于文本嵌入和图像嵌入在语义和结构上具有显著差异，为两种模态分别设置独立的参数。这一设计等价于为文本模态和图像模态各自构建一个独立的 Transformer；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc9732a56" id="uc9732a56" style="color: #00346B">但在注意力计算时，将两种模态的 token 序列合并在一起，从而使两种表示能够在各自的特征空间中进行处理，同时又能够通过注意力机制感知并利用另一种模态的信息</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua4fb4789" id="ua4fb4789" style="color: #00346B">​</span></li></ul>